\">製品は背面が2重構造のため、持ち上げた際にアクリル板のすれる音がする場合があります。</li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n</div>','2019-06-24 02:23:38','2020-02-05 05:33:08'),(330,4,'【アクリルケース】コレクションケース','<div class=\"l-article--column-1\">\r\n  <section class=\"article__content\">\r\n    <table class=\"c-table--sm u-whitespace--nowrap\">\r\n      <tbody>\r\n        <tr>\r\n          <th>\r\n          </th>\r\n          <th>サイズ</th>\r\n          <th>段数</th>\r\n          <th>全体の外寸法</th>\r\n          <th>1段の内寸法</th>\r\n          <th>本体色</th>\r\n          <th>背面色</th>\r\n          <th>図面</th>\r\n        </tr>\r\n        <tr>\r\n          <th rowspan=\"3\">Aタイプ</th>\r\n          <td>S</td>\r\n          <td>8</td>\r\n          <td>W400xD120xH591mm</td>\r\n          <td>W380xD100xH65mm</td>\r\n          <td>ガラスエッジ</td>\r\n          <td>ミラー</td>\r\n          <td class=\"js-modal\"><a data-target=\"a_s\" class=\"js-modal__trigger--open\"><i class=\"c-icon--triangle-r\"></i>寸法図面</a>\r\n            <div id=\"a_s\" class=\"c-window--md c-form js-modal__content\"><img src=\"/storage/images/collection/collection_case/a_s.gif\" class=\"u-display--block u-margin--auto\"></div>\r\n          </td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n        <tr>\r\n          <td>M</td>\r\n          <td>10</td>\r\n          <td>W550xD120xH740mm</td>\r\n          <td>W530xD100xH65mm</td>\r\n          <td>ガラスエッジ</td>\r\n          <td>ミラー</td>\r\n          <td class=\"js-modal\"><a data-target=\"a_m\" class=\"js-modal__trigger--open\"><i class=\"c-icon--triangle-r\"></i>寸法図面</a>\r\n            <div id=\"a_m\" class=\"c-window--md c-form js-modal__content\"><img src=\"/storage/images/collection/collection_case/a_m.gif\" class=\"u-display--block u-margin--auto\"></div>\r\n          </td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n        <tr>\r\n          <td>L</td>\r\n          <td>12</td>\r\n          <td>W700xD120xH889mm</td>\r\n          <td>W680xD100xH65mm</td>\r\n          <td>ガラスエッジ</td>\r\n          <td>ミラー</td>\r\n          <td class=\"js-modal\"><a data-target=\"a_l\" class=\"js-modal__trig