型板ガラスを上回る強度があり、また破損した場合でも破片が飛び散り難くく、建材・窓ガラス用途に広く使用されています。</li>\r\n      </ul>\r\n      <ul class=\"c-list--note\">\r\n        <li class=\"list__item\">アクリルやポリカーボネートに比べると強度は落ちます。</li>\r\n      </ul>\r\n    </div>\r\n    <h2 class=\"c-heading--lg-border\">素材別 型模様板の使用用途例</h2>\r\n    <div class=\"l-article--column-1\">\r\n      <table class=\"c-table--sm u-whitespace--nowrap\">\r\n        <tbody>\r\n          <tr>\r\n            <th colspan=\"2\" class=\"c-text--sm-center\">ポリカーボネート</th>\r\n            <th class=\"c-text--sm-center\">ポリスチレン</th>\r\n            <th colspan=\"2\" class=\"c-text--sm-center\">アクリル</th>\r\n          </tr>\r\n          <tr>\r\n            <td><div><a data-target=\"konami\" class=\"js-modal__trigger--open\"><img src=\"/storage/images/etc_plastic/polystyrene/polystyrene_3.jpg\"></a>\r\n            <div id=\"konami\" class=\"c-window--md c-form js-modal__content\"><img src=\"/storage/images/etc_plastic/polystyrene/polystyrene_3.jpg\" class=\"u-display--block u-margin--auto\"></div></div></td>\r\n            <td><div><a data-target=\"kasumi\" class=\"js-modal__trigger--open\"><img src=\"/storage/images/etc_plastic/polystyrene/polystyrene_4.jpg\"></a>\r\n            <div id=\"kasumi\" class=\"c-window--md c-form js-modal__content\"><img src=\"/storage/images/etc_plastic/polystyrene/polystyrene_4.jpg\" class=\"u-display--block u-margin--auto\"></div></div></td>\r\n            <td><div><a data-target=\"c589s\" class=\"js-modal__trigger--open\"><img src=\"/storage/images/etc_plastic/polystyrene/polystyrene_2.jpg\"></a>\r\n            <div id=\"c589s\" class=\"c-window--md c-form js-modal__content\"><img src=\"/storage/images/etc_plastic/polystyrene/polystyrene_2.jpg\" class=\"u-display--block u-margin--auto\"></div></div></td>\r\n            <td><div><a data-target=\"luminek1\" class=\"js-modal__trigger--open\"><img src=\"/storage/images/etc_plastic/polystyrene/polystyrene_5.jpg\"></a>\r\n            <div id=\"luminek1\" class=\"c-window--md c-form j