n                                                        </li>\r\n                                                        <li class=\"list__item\">小数点第1位まで0.1mm単位で入力可能<br>（例：φ4.2、φ8.7など）</li>\r\n                                                      </ul>\r\n                                                    </div>\r\n                                                  </div>\r\n                                                  <div class=\"l-article--column-2-vertical\">\r\n                                                    <div class=\"article__content--w20\"><img src=\"/assets/images/products/semi_order/10/img_option4_02.jpg\"></div>\r\n                                                    <div class=\"article__content--w80 js-modal\">\r\n                                                      <h4 class=\"c-heading--sm\">タップ穴（ネジ穴）</h4>\r\n                                                      <ul class=\"c-list--disc\">\r\n                                                        <li class=\"list__item\">ネジを固定できるメスネジ山付きの貫通穴</li>\r\n                                                        <li class=\"list__item\">M3～M10まで入力可能</li>\r\n                                                      </ul><a data-target=\"hole-02\" class=\"c-button--xs-gray js-modal__trigger--open\">詳細寸法</a>\r\n                                                      <div id=\"hole-02\" class=\"c-window--md js-modal__content\"><img src=\"/assets/images/products/semi_order/10/img_option4_03.jpg\"></div>\r\n                                                    </div>\r\n                                                  </div>\r\n                                                  <div class=\"l-article--column-2-vertical\">\r\n                                                    <div class=\"article__content--w20\"><img src=\"/assets/images/products/semi_order/10/img_option4_04.jpg\"></div>\r\n                                                    <div class=\"article__content--w80 js-modal\">\r\n                                                      <h4 class=\"c-heading--sm\">サラザグリ（皿穴）</h4>\r\n                                                      <ul class=\"c-list--disc\">\r\n                                                        <li class=\"list__item\">サラネジの頭を板の平面に合わせて平らに固定する貫通穴</li>\r\n                                                        <li class=\"list__item\">	M3～M10まで入力可能</li>\r\n                                                      </ul><a data-target=\"hole-03\" class=\"c-button--xs-gray js-modal__trigger--open\">詳細寸法</a>\r\n                                                      <div id=\"hole-03\" class=\"c-window--md js-modal__content\"><img src=\"/assets/images/products/semi_order/10/img_option4_05.jpg\"></div>\r\n                                                    </div>\r\n                                                  </div>\r\n                                                  <div class=\"l-article--column-2-vertical\">\r\n                                                    <div class=\"article__content--w20\"><img src=\"/assets/images/products/semi_order/10/img_option4_06.jpg\"></div>\r\n                                                    <div class=\"article__content--w80 js-modal\">\r\n                                                      <h4 class=\"c-heading--sm\">キャップボルトザグリ（平ザグリ）</h4>\r\n                                                      <ul class=\"c-list--disc\">\r\n                                                        <li class=\"list__item\">キャップボルトの頭を板に埋没させる段付き貫通穴</li>\r\n                                                        <li class=\"list__item\">M3～M10まで入力可能</li>\r\n                                                      </ul><a data-target=\"hole-04\" class=\"c-button--xs-gray js-modal__trigger--open\">詳細寸法</a>\r\n                                                      <div id=\"hole-04\" class=\"c-window--md js-modal__content\"><img src=\"/assets/images/products/semi_order/10/img_option4_07.jpg\"></div>\r\n                                                    </div>\r\n                                                  </div>\r\n                                                </div>\r\n                                              </div>\r\n                                              <div class=\"article__content js-accordion\"><a class=\"js-accordion__trigger\"><i class=\"c-icon--toggle\"></i>入力に関する詳細</a>\r\n                                                <div class=\"js-accordion__content\">\r\n                                                  <ul class=\"c-list--disc\">\r\n                                                    <li class=\"list__item\">穴の淵が端面から近い場合は指定できません。</li>\r\n                                                    <li class=\"list__item\">選択できない使用ネジサイズは指定できません。</li>\r\n                                                    <li class=\"list__item\">板の厚みが1mmの場合、丸穴以外は指定できません。</li>\r\n                                                    <li class=\"list__item\">穴の断面は細目仕上になります（磨き仕上は不可）。</li>\r\n                                                  </ul>\r\n                                                </div>\r\n                                              </div>\r\n                                            </div>\r\n                                          </div>\r\n                                        </div>\r\n                                      </section>\r\n                                      <!--option 5-->\r\n                                      <section class=\"section__option js-accordion\"><a data-target=\"step-op-05\" class=\"option__title js-accordion__trigger\"><img src=\"/assets/images/icon/icon_processing_neji.svg\">テーパーネジ穴加工<i class=\"c-icon--toggle\"></i></a>\r\n                                        <div id=\"step-op-05\" class=\"option__content js-accordion__content\">\r\n                                          <div class=\"l-article--column-1\">\r\n                                            <div id=\"taper_off\"></div>\r\n                                