まで入力可能</li>\r\n                                                        </ul><a data-target=\"hole-02\" class=\"c-button--xs-gray js-modal__trigger--open\">詳細寸法</a>\r\n                                                        <div id=\"hole-02\" class=\"c-window--md js-modal__content\"><img src=\"/assets/images/products/semi_order/18/img_option4_03.jpg\"></div>\r\n                                                      </div>\r\n                                                    </div>\r\n                                                    <div class=\"l-article--column-2-vertical-center\">\r\n                                                      <div class=\"article__content--w30\"><img src=\"/assets/images/products/semi_order/18/img_option4_04.jpg\" class=\"js-modal--image\"></div>\r\n                                                      <div class=\"article__content--w70 js-modal\">\r\n                                                        <h4 class=\"c-heading--sm\">サラザグリ（皿穴）</h4>\r\n                                                        <ul class=\"c-list--disc\">\r\n                                                          <li class=\"list__item\">サラネジの頭を板の平面に合わせて平らに固定する貫通穴</li>\r\n                                                          <li class=\"list__item\">	M3～M10まで入力可能</li>\r\n                                                        </ul><a data-target=\"hole-03\" class=\"c-button--xs-gray js-modal__trigger--open\">詳細寸法</a>\r\n                                                        <div id=\"hole-03\" class=\"c-window--md js-modal__content\"><img src=\"/assets/images/products/semi_order/18/img_option4_05.jpg\"></div>\r\n                                                      </div>\r\n                                                    </div>\r\n                                                    <div class=\"l-article--column-2-vertical-center\">\r\n                                                      <div class=\"article__content--w30\"><img src=\"/asset