                    <div class=\"js-dropdown__trigger\">\r\n                                                        <p class=\"flow__balloon c-window--balloon-b js-dropdown__content\">サイズ</p>\r\n                                                      </div></a><a href=\"#step-04\" class=\"js-dropdown js-anchorScroll\">\r\n                                                      <div class=\"js-dropdown__trigger\">\r\n                                                        <p class=\"flow__balloon c-window--balloon-b js-dropdown__content\">確認</p>\r\n                                                      </div></a>\r\n                                                  </div>\r\n                                                  <div class=\"flow__progress js-flow__progress\"></div>\r\n                                                </div>\r\n                              <!-- フォーム-->\r\n                              <div class=\"overview__form\">\r\n                                <dl class=\"form__item form__num\">\r\n                                  <dt>数量:</dt>\r\n                                  <dd><span class=\"form__number\">\r\n                                      <button type=\"button\" class=\"number__button--plus c-button--md-white\"><i class=\"c-icon--plus\"></i></button>\r\n                                      <input name=\"suu\" type=\"text\" id=\"suu\" onChange=\"calculation();global_weight();\" maxlength=\"3\" data-max=\"9999\" data-min=\"1\" placeholder=\"1\" value=\"1\">\r\n                                      <button type=\"button\" class=\"number__button--minus c-button--md-white\"><i class=\"c-icon--minus\"></i></button><span class=\"form__effect\"></span></span></dd>\r\n                                </dl>\r\n                              </div>\r\n                              <!-- 金額-->\r\n                              <div class=\"overview__price\">\r\n                                <dl class=\"price__item\">\r\n                                  <dt>単価:</dt>\r\n                                  <dd>\r\n                                    <input name=\"body_sale_price\" type=\"text\" id=\"price\" onChange=\"calculation();\" tabindex=\"-1\" readonly value=\"0\" class=\"c-price--md\"><span>円（税抜）</span>\r\n                                  </dd>\r\n                                </dl>\r\n                                <dl class=\"price__item\">\r\n                                  <dt>合計:</dt>\r\n                                  <dd>\r\n                                    <input name=\"total_body_sale_price\" type=\"text\" id=\"total_body_sale_price\" onChange=\"calculation();\" tabindex=\"-1\" readonly value=\"0\" class=\"c-price--md js-products__price\"><span>円（税抜）</span>\r\n                                  </dd>\r\n                                </dl>\r\n                                <dl class=\"price__item\">\r\n                                  <dt></dt>\r\n                                  <dd>\r\n                                    <input name=\"total_price_tax\" type=\"text\" id=\"total_price_tax\" onchange=\"calculation()\" maxlength=\"8\" readonly tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"c-price--lg js-products__price\"><span>円（税込）</span>\r\n                                  </dd>\r\n                                </dl>\r\n                              </div>\r\n                              <!-- 購入情報-->\r\n                              <div class=\"overview__order\">\r\n                                <!--\r\n                                dl.order__item\r\n                                  dt 定価:\r\n                                  dd 1,000円\r\n                                dl.order__item\r\n                                  dt.c-text--sm-danger 割引額（率）:\r\n                                  dd.c-text--sm-danger 1,000円（90%）\r\n                                -->\r\n                                {%delivery_schedule%}\r\n                                                    <div id=\"global\" class=\"js-modal\">\r\n                                                      <dl class=\"order__item\">\r\n                                                        <dt><a data-target=\"oogataDetail\" class=\"c-label--md-oogata js-modal__trigger--open\">大型便</a>\r\n                                                          <div id=\"oogataDetail\" class=\"c-window--md js-modal__content\">\r\n                                                            <p class=\"c-heading--md\">大型便について</p>\r\n                                                            <p>運送上の都合で製品サイズが 「横＋縦＋奥行＝1400mm以上」の場合、代金引換と到着時間の指定はご利用頂けません。<br>予めご了承下さい。</p>\r\n                                                          </div>\r\n                                                        </dt>\r\n                                                      </dl>\r\n                                                      <div id=\"oogata\"></div>\r\n                                                    </div>\r\n                                <div id=\"haisou\" class=\"js-modal\">\r\n                                  <dl id=\"kojin_deliver\" class=\"order__item\">\r\n                                    <dt><a data-target=\"kojinDetail\" class=\"c-label--md-kojin js-modal__trigger--open\">個人宅配送料</a>\r\n                                      <div id=\"kojinDetail\" class=\"c-window--md js-modal__content\">\r\n                                        <p class=\"c-heading--md\">個人宅配送料について</p>\r\n                                        <p>製品サイズの幅・奥行・高さ（又は、縦・横）の合計が1750mmを超えるサイズで、お届け先が個人宅の場合、基本料金とは別に加算されます。</p>\r\n                                      </div>\r\n                                    </dt>\r\n                                    <dd><span id=\"haisou_price\"></span>円（税抜）\r\n                                      <input id=\"haisou_cost\" type=\"hidden\" name=\"haisou_cost\" value=\"\" class=\"js-products__haisou u-display--none\">\r\n                                    </dd>\r\n                                  </dl>\r\n                                  <dl id=\"area_deliver\" class=\"order__item\">\r\n                                    <dt><a data-target=\"enpouDetail\" class=\"c-label--md-enpou js-modal__trigger--open\">遠方配送料</a>\r\n                                      {%enpou_parts%}\r\n                                    </dt>\r\n                                    <dd><span id=\"area_price\"></span>円（税抜）本州除く\r\n                                      <input id=\"area_cost\" type=\"hidden\" name=\"area_cost\" value=\"\" class=\"js-products__haisou u-display--none\">\r\n                                    </dd>\r\n                                  </dl>\r\n                                </div>\r\n                                <div class=\"order__action\">\r\n                                  <button type=\"button\" onclick=\"form_submit()\" class=\"action__button c-button--xl-cart\"><i class=\"button__icon--before\"><img src=\"/assets/images/icon/icon_cart_w.svg\"></i>カートに入れる</button>\r\n                                </div>\r\n                              </div>\r\n                              {%relation_link%}\r\n                              <!-- スマホ用-->\r\n                                                <div class=\"overview__fixed\">\r\n                                                  <div class=\"fixed__flow c-flow js-flow__navigation is-clone\">\r\n                                                    <div class=\"flow__step js-flow__step\"><a href=\"#step-01\" class=\"js-dropdown js-anchorScroll\">\r\n                                                        <div class=\"js-dropdown__trigger\">\r\n                                                          <p class=\"flow__balloon c-window--balloon-b js-dropdown__content\">お届け先</p>\r\n                                                        </div></a><a href=\"#step-02\" class=\"js-dropdown js-anchorScroll\">\r\n                                                        <div class=\"js-dropdown__trigger\">\r\n                                                          <p class=\"flow__balloon c-window--balloon-b js-dropdown__content\">色</p>\r\n                                                        </div></a><a href=\"#step-03\" class=\"js-dropdown js-anchorScroll\">\r\n                                                        <div class=\"js-dropdown__trigger\">\r\n                                                          <p class=\"flow__balloon c-window--balloon-b js-dropdown__content\">サイズ</p>\r\n                                                        </div></a><a href=\"#step-04\" class=\"js-dropdown js-anchorScroll\">\r\n                                                        <div class=\"js-dropdown__trigger\">\r\n                                                          <p class=\"flow__balloon c-window--balloon-b js-dropdown__content\">確認</p>\r\n                                                        </div></a>\r\n                                                    </div>\r\n                                                    <div class=\"flow__progress js-flow__progress\"></div>\r\n                                                  </div>\r\n                                                  <div class=\"fixed__price\"><span>合計: </span>\r\n                                                    <p class=\"c-price--md js-products__comma\">0</p><span>円（税込）</span>\r\n                                                  </div><a href=\"#purchase\" class=\"fixed__button c-button--md-cart js-anchorScroll\">数量・金額を確認</a>\r\n                                                </div>\r\n                            </div>\r\n                          </div>\r\n                          <!-- 商品紹介パート-->\r\n                          <div class=\"overview__promotion js-scrollFixed__standard\">\r\n                            <div class=\"overview__mainVisual js-imageSwitch js-products__mainVisual\">\r\n                              <div class=\"mainVisual__slider js-imageSwitch__target\">\r\n                                <figure class=\"slider__item is-active\">\r\n                                  <div class=\"item__frame js-imageSwitch__item is-active\"><img src=\"/storage/images/rittai_gaku/rittaigaku_box_semi/rittaigaku_box_semi_1.jpg\"></div>\r\n                                </figure>\r\n                              </div>\r\n                              <div class=\"mainVisual__description c-heading--sm-primary\">ホコリが付かずに壁に飾れるアクリル製ボックスタイプの立体額。<br>イベントなどで、展示物をお客様が触れて破損してしまうことも防げます。<br>セミオーダーなので、展示物のサイズに合わせて製作いたします。</div>\r\n                              <div class=\"mainVisual__anchor\"><a href=\"#spec\" class=\"anchor__button c-button--md-gray js-anchorScroll\">製品仕様<i class=\"button__icon--after c-icon--arrow-b\"></i></a><a href=\"#input\" class=\"anchor__button c-button--md-gray js-anchorScroll\">お見積・ご注文入力<i class=\"button__icon--after c-icon--arrow-b\"></i></a></div>\r\n                            </div>{%product_feature%}\r\n                            <div class=\"overview__detail\">\r\n                              <div class=\"detail__section\">\r\n                                <h2 class=\"c-heading--lg-border\">製品特長</h2>\r\n                                <div class=\"l-article--column-1\">\r\n                                  <div class=\"article__content\">\r\n                                    <h3 class=\"c-heading--sm\">プライベートからショールームまで</h3>\r\n                                    <p>個人様から法人様のイベント、ショールームの展示まで、様々な用途に対応します。</p>\r\n                                  </div>\r\n                                  <div class=\"article__content\">\r\n                                    <h3 class=\"c-heading--sm\">埃やいたずらからガード</h3>\r\n                                    <p>大切な展示物を埃から守り、またいたずらなどの破損も軽減します。</p>\r\n                                  </div>\r\n                                  <div class=\"article__content\">\r\n                                    <h3 class=\"c-heading--sm\">台は白・黒の２色から選択可能</h3>\r\n                                    <p>展示物に合わせ、白・黒どちらかの台をお選びいただけます。</p>\r\n                                  </div>\r\n                                  <div class=\"article__content\">\r\n                                    <h3 class=\"c-heading--sm\">縦・横どちらでも使用可能</h3>\r\n                                    <p>製品は縦・横どちら向きでも壁に掛けられるように、背面に固定具が付いています。展示物を変更し、向きを変えて飾ることが可能です。</p>\r\n                                  </div>\r\n                                  <div class=\"article__content\">\r\n                                    <h3 class=\"c-heading--sm\">劣化に強いUVカットが選択可能</h3>\r\n                                    <p>アクリルケースは中の展示品を紫外線劣化から守るUVカットも選択できます。紫外線による変色が心配される大切な品も安心です。</p>\r\n                                  </div>\r\n                                </div>\r\n                                <div class=\"l-article--column-3\">\r\n                                  <div class=\"article__content\"><img src=\"/assets/images/products/semi_order/34/img_slider02.jpg\" class=\"js-modal--image\">\r\n                                    <p class=\"c-text--sm\">展示物に合わせ、白・黒どちらかの色の台をお選びいただけます。</p>\r\n                                  </div>\r\n                                  <div class=\"article__content\"><img src=\"/assets/images/products/semi_order/34/img_slider03.jpg\" class=\"js-modal--image\">\r\n                                    <p class=\"c-text--sm\">アクリルケースはネジにより固定するため、大切な展示物をいたずらなどでの破損を軽減します。</p>\r\n                                  </div>\r\n                                  <div class=\"article__content\"><img src=\"/assets/images/products/semi_order/34/img_slider04.jpg\" class=\"js-modal--image\">\r\n                                    <p class=\"c-text--sm\">台裏の角3カ所に壁掛け用の穴があるため、縦・横どちらでも使用が可能です。</p>\r\n                                  </div>\r\n                                </div>\r\n                                <div class=\"l-article--column-3\">\r\n                                  <div class=\"article__content\"><img src=\"/assets/images/products/semi_order/34/img_slider05.jpg\" class=\"js-modal--image\">\r\n                                    <p class=\"c-text--sm\">固定の難しい品は、台に穴を開け針金で止めることも可能です。<br>※<a href=\"/blog/product/436/\" target=\"_blank\">使用レポート</a>参照。</p>\r\n                                  </div>\r\n                                  <div class=\"article__content\"><img src=\"/assets/images/products/semi_order/34/img_slider06.jpg\" class=\"js-modal--image\">\r\n                                    <p class=\"c-text--sm\">軽量な大型の立体物であれば、奥行の深さを利用し飾ることが可能です。</p>\r\n                                  </div>\r\n                                  <div class=\"article__content\"><img src=\"/assets/images/products/semi_order/34/img_slider07.jpg\" class=\"js-modal--image\">\r\n                                    <p class=\"c-text--sm\">重い品や固定が出来ない場合には、寝かせて飾ることも可能です。</p>\r\n                                  </div>\r\n                                </div>\r\n                              </div>\r\n                              <div class=\"detail__section\">\r\n                                <h2 class=\"c-heading--lg-border\">動画</h2>\r\n                                <div class=\"l-article--column-2\">\r\n                                  <div class=\"article__content\">\r\n                                    <div class=\"c-iframe\">\r\n                                      <iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/pTIpAi_9L7s\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe>\r\n                                    </div>\r\n                                    <p class=\"c-text--sm-center\">立体額BOXタイプ組立方法</p>\r\n                                  </div>\r\n                                  <div class=\"article__content\">\r\n                                    <div class=\"c-iframe\">\r\n                                      <iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/c8nPyirSE7w\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe>\r\n                                    </div>\r\n                                    <p class=\"c-text--sm-center\">ネジ位置設定方法</p>\r\n                                  </div>\r\n                                </div>\r\n                              </div>\r\n                              <div id=\"spec\" class=\"detail__section js-flow\">\r\n                                <h2 class=\"c-heading--lg-border\">製品仕様</h2>\r\n                                <div class=\"l-article--column-1\">\r\n                                  <div class=\"article__content\">\r\n                                    <table class=\"c-table\">\r\n                                      <tbody>\r\n                                        <tr>\r\n                                          <th>ケース対応サイズ</th>\r\n                                          <td>最少：横110x縦110x奥行60mm<br>最大：横900x縦900x奥行330mm</td>\r\n                                        </tr>\r\n                                        <tr>\r\n                                          <th>素材　厚さ</th>\r\n                                          <td>アクリル　3mm厚</td>\r\n                                        </tr>\r\n                                        <tr>\r\n                                          <th>素材色</th>\r\n                                          <td>カバー：クリアー/UVカットクリアー<br>台：ブラック/ホワイト</td>\r\n                                        </tr>\r\n                                        <tr>\r\n                                          <th>構造　仕上</th>\r\n                                          <td>カバー/台：接着構造<br>カバー手前四つ角：面取り仕上げ</td>\r\n                                        </tr>\r\n                                        <tr>\r\n                                          <th>付属品</th>\r\n                                          <td>M4 L8サラネジ：4～8個\r\n                                            <p class=\"c-text--sm-note\">黒色の台は黒色のネジ、白色の台は銀色のネジになります。</p>\r\n                                          </td>\r\n                                        </tr>\r\n                                      </tbody>\r\n                                    </table>\r\n                                  </div>\r\n                                </div>\r\n                                <div class=\"l-article--column-1\">\r\n                                  <div class=\"article__content\"><a href=\"/assets/pdf/products/semi_order/34/pdf_34_01.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"c-button--sm-gray\">組立方法</a></div>\r\n                                  <div class=\"article__content\">\r\n                                    <ul class=\"c-list--sm-note\">\r\n                                      <li class=\"list__item\">設置の壁は、強度の高い木部（厚めの合板を含む）になります。壁によっては設置に適さない場合があります。壁の強度不足による製品落下に関する保障は致しかねます。</li>\r\n                                      <li class=\"list__item\">壁面設置の際は、<a data-target=\"wallCaution\" class=\"js-modal__trigger--open\">設置壁面に関する事前確認について </a>\r\n                                        <div id=\"wallCaution\" class=\"c-window--md js-modal__content\">\r\n                                          <div class=\"l-article--column-1\">\r\n                                            <div class=\"article__content\">\r\n                                              <h4 class=\"c-heading--sm\">設置壁面に関する事前確認について</h4>\r\n                                            </div>\r\n                                            <div class=\"article__content c-cardGroup--3-vertical\">\r\n                                              <div class=\"c-card--step-vertical\">\r\n                                                <div class=\"card__head\">\r\n                                                  <p class=\"card__title c-heading--md\"><span class=\"card__step\">STEP 01</span></p>\r\n                                                  <div class=\"card__image\"><img src=\"/assets/images/products/semi_order/32/img_step3_02.jpg\"></div>\r\n                                                </div>\r\n                                                <div class=\"card__body\">\r\n                                                  <div class=\"card__discription\">\r\n                                                    <p>ホームセンターなどで市販されている木ねじ（長さ30ミリ以上推奨）を準備します。</p>\r\n                                                  </div>\r\n                                                </div>\r\n                                              </div>\r\n                                              <div class=\"c-card--step-vertical\">\r\n                                                <div class=\"card__head\">\r\n                                                  <p class=\"card__title c-heading--md\"><span class=\"card__step\">STEP 02</span></p>\r\n                                                  <div class=\"card__image\"><img src=\"/assets/images/products/semi_order/32/img_step3_03.jpg\"></div>\r\n                                                  <div class=\"card__discription\">\r\n                                                    <p>準備した木ねじを設置する場所に固定します。</p>\r\n                                                  </div>\r\n                                                </div>\r\n                                                <div class=\"card__body\"></div>\r\n                                              </div>\r\n                                              <div class=\"c-card--step-vertical\">\r\n                                                <div class=\"card__head\">\r\n                                                  <p class=\"card__title c-heading--md\"><span class=\"card__step\">STEP 03</span></p>\r\n                                                  <div class=\"card__image\"><img src=\"/assets/images/products/semi_order/32/img_step3_04.jpg\"></div>\r\n                                                </div>\r\n                                                <div class=\"card__body\">\r\n                                                  <div class=\"card__discription\">\r\n                                                    <p>フレームの重量を商品ページでご確認頂き、フレームと同じ重量の物（テストウエイト）を木ねじに掛けて下さい。木ねじが緩む場合は、設置に適しません。</p>\r\n                                                    <p class=\"c-text--sm-notes\">電話帳1冊が約1kgです。体重計で測ってフレームと同じ重さのテストウエイトを準備して下さい。</p>\r\n                                                  </div>\r\n                                                </div>\r\n                                              </div>\r\n                                            </div>\r\n                                          </div>\r\n                                        </div>参照。\r\n                                      </li>\r\n                                    </ul>\r\n                                  </div>\r\n                                </div>\r\n                              </div>\r\n                              <div id=\"input\" class=\"detail__section js-flow\">\r\n                                <h2 class=\"c-heading--lg-border\">お見積・ご注文入力</h2>\r\n                                <div class=\"js-flow__target\">\r\n                                  <!--step 1-->\r\n                                  <section id=\"step-01\" class=\"l-article--column-1 c-flame--xs-semiorder\">\r\n                                    <h3 class=\"c-heading--md\">\r\n                                      <p class=\"heading__sub--before c-label--lg-primary\">STEP 1</p>お届け先を選択\r\n                                    </h3>\r\n                                    <div class=\"l-article--column-1\">\r\n                                      <div class=\"article__content\">\r\n                                        <div class=\"c-flame--xs-gray\">\r\n                                          <dl class=\"section__set\">\r\n                                            <dt class=\"set__item\">お届け先  </dt>\r\n                                            <dd class=\"set__content\">\r\n                                              <div class=\"form__select u-width--100\">\r\n                                                <select name=\"souhu_info\" size=\"1\" id=\"souhu_info\" onChange=\"calculation();\">\r\n                                                  <option selected value=\"個人\">個人宅</option>\r\n                                                  <option value=\"法人\">法人宛</option>\r\n                                                </select>\r\n                                              </div>\r\n                                            </dd>\r\n                                          </dl>\r\n                                        </div>\r\n                                      </div>\r\n                                    </div>\r\n                                  </section>\r\n                                  <!--step 2-->\r\n                                  <section id=\"step-02\" class=\"l-article--column-1 c-flame--xs-semiorder\">\r\n                                    <h3 class=\"c-heading--md\">\r\n                                      <p class=\"heading__sub--before c-label--lg-primary\">STEP 2</p>色を選択\r\n                                    </h3>\r\n                                    <div class=\"l-article--column-1\">\r\n                                      <div class=\"article__content\"><a data-target=\"uvCut\" class=\"link__icon--before js-modal__trigger--open\"><i class=\"c-icon--triangle-r\"></i>UVカット素材の詳細</a>\r\n                                        <div id=\"uvCut\" class=\"c-window--md js-modal__content\">\r\n                                          <h4 class=\"c-heading--sm-center\">紫外線カット(UVcut)クリアー素材の詳細</h4>\r\n                                          <div class=\"l-article--column-1\">\r\n                                            <div class=\"article__content\"><img src=\"/assets/images/products/semi_order/37/img_step2_01.jpg\">\r\n                                              <p>紫外線カット板は紫外線を遮断する成分の特性でわずかに黄色掛かっております。予めご了承の上、お求め願います。</p>\r\n                                            </div>\r\n                                          </div>\r\n                                          <div class=\"l-article--column-2\">\r\n                                            <div class=\"article__content\"><img src=\"/assets/images/products/semi_order/37/img_step2_02.jpg\"></div>\r\n                                            <div class=\"article__content\"><img src=\"/assets/images/products/semi_order/37/img_step2_03.jpg\"></div>\r\n                                          </div>\r\n                                        </div>\r\n                                      </div>\r\n                                      <div class=\"article__content\">\r\n                                        <div class=\"c-flame--xs-gray\">\r\n                                          <dl class=\"section__set\">\r\n                                            <dt class=\"set__item\">本体カバー色  </dt>\r\n                                            <dd class=\"set__content\">\r\n                                              <div class=\"form__select u-width--100\">\r\n                                                <select name=\"body_color_c\" id=\"body_color_c\" onChange=\"calculation();\">\r\n                                                  <option selected value=\"クリアー\">クリアー</option>\r\n                                                  <option value=\"UVカットクリアー\">UVカットクリアー</option>\r\n                                                </select>\r\n                                              </div>\r\n                                            </dd>\r\n                                          </dl>\r\n                                          <dl class=\"section__set\">\r\n                                            <dt class=\"set__item\">台色  </dt>\r\n                                            <dd class=\"set__content\">\r\n                                              <div class=\"form__select u-width--100\">\r\n                                                <select name=\"body_color_p\" id=\"body_color_p\" onChange=\"calculation()\">\r\n                                                  <option selected value=\"ブラック\">ブラック</option>\r\n                                                  <option value=\"ホワイト\">ホワイト</option>\r\n                                                </select>\r\n                                              </div>\r\n                                            </dd>\r\n                                          </dl>\r\n                                        </div>\r\n                                      </div>\r\n                                    </div>\r\n                                  </section>\r\n                                  <!--step 3-->\r\n                                  <section id=\"step-03\" class=\"l-article--column-1 c-flame--xs-semiorder\">\r\n                                    <h3 class=\"c-heading--md\">\r\n                                      <p class=\"heading__sub--before c-label--lg-primary\">STEP 3</p>ケースのサイズを入力\r\n                                    </h3>\r\n                                    <div class=\"l-article--column-2-reverse-center\">\r\n                                      <div class=\"article__content-w60\">\r\n                                        <div class=\"c-flame--xs-gray\">\r\n                                          <dl class=\"section__set\">\r\n                                            <dt class=\"set__item\">横</dt>\r\n                                            <dd class=\"set__content\">\r\n                                              <div class=\"content__unit\">\r\n                                                <p class=\"unit__inline\">\r\n                                                  <input name=\"body_long\" type=\"text\" id=\"body_long\" onChange=\"calculation();global_weight();\" maxlength=\"3\" value=\"0\"><span>mm</span>\r\n                                                </p>\r\n                                              </div>\r\n                                              <p class=\"content__note\">（入力範囲 : 110～900mm）</p>\r\n                                            </dd>\r\n                                          </dl>\r\n                                          <dl class=\"section__set\">\r\n                                            <dt class=\"set__item\">縦</dt>\r\n                                            <dd class=\"set__content\">\r\n                                              <div class=\"content__unit\">\r\n                                                <p class=\"unit__inline\">\r\n                                                  <input name=\"body_short\" type=\"text\" id=\"body_short\" onChange=\"calculation();global_weight();\" maxlength=\"3\" value=\"0\"><span>mm</span>\r\n                                                </p>\r\n                                              </div>\r\n                                              <p class=\"content__note\">（入力範囲 : 110～900mm）</p>\r\n                                            </dd>\r\n                                          </dl>\r\n                                          <dl class=\"section__set\">\r\n                                            <dt class=\"set__item\">奥行</dt>\r\n                                            <dd class=\"set__content\">\r\n                                              <div class=\"content__unit\">\r\n                                                <p class=\"unit__inline\">\r\n                                                  <input name=\"body_thickness\" type=\"text\" id=\"body_thickness\" onChange=\"calculation();global_weight();\" maxlength=\"3\" value=\"0\"><span>mm</span>\r\n                                                </p>\r\n                                              </div>\r\n                                              <p class=\"content__note\">（入力範囲 : 60～330mm）</p>\r\n                                            </dd>\r\n                                          </dl>\r\n                                          <dl class=\"section__set\">\r\n                                            <dt class=\"set__item\">厚み</dt>\r\n                                            <dd class=\"set__content\">\r\n                                              <div class=\"content__unit\"><b class=\"content__number form__output\">3</b><span>mm</span></div>\r\n                                            </dd>\r\n                                          </dl>\r\n                                          <dl class=\"section__set\">\r\n                                            <dt class=\"set__item u-width--80\">横(内寸)</dt>\r\n                                            <dd class=\"set__content\">\r\n                                              <div class=\"content__unit\">\r\n                                                <p class=\"unit__inline\">\r\n                                                  <input name=\"outside_width\" type=\"text\" id=\"outside_width\" maxlength=\"3\" readonly tabindex=\"-1\" value=\"0\" class=\"content__number form__output\"><span>mm</span>\r\n                                                </p>\r\n                                              </div>\r\n                                            </dd>\r\n                                          </dl>\r\n                                          <dl class=\"section__set\">\r\n                                            <dt class=\"set__item u-width--80\">縦(内寸)</dt>\r\n                                            <dd class=\"set__content\">\r\n                                              <div class=\"content__unit\">\r\n                                                <p class=\"unit__inline\">\r\n                                                  <input name=\"outside_height\" type=\"text\" id=\"outside_height\" maxlength=\"3\" readonly tabindex=\"-1\" value=\"0\" class=\"content__number form__output\"><span>mm</span>\r\n                                                </p>\r\n                                              </div>\r\n                                            </dd>\r\n                                          </dl>\r\n                                          <dl class=\"section__set\">\r\n                                            <dt class=\"set__item u-width--80\">奥行(内寸)</dt>\r\n                                            <dd class=\"set__content\">\r\n                                              <div class=\"content__unit\">\r\n                                                <p class=\"unit__inline\">\r\n                                                  <input name=\"outside_depth\" type=\"text\" id=\"outside_depth\" maxlength=\"3\" readonly tabindex=\"-1\" value=\"0\" class=\"content__number form__output\"><span>mm</span>\r\n                                                </p>\r\n                                              </div>\r\n                                            </dd>\r\n                                          </dl>\r\n                                          <dl class=\"section__set\">\r\n                                            <dt class=\"set__item\">重量</dt>\r\n                                            <dd class=\"set__content\">\r\n                                              <div class=\"content__unit\">\r\n                                                <p class=\"unit__inline\"><span>約</span>\r\n                                                  <input name=\"weight\" type=\"text\" id=\"weight\" maxlength=\"4\" readonly tabindex=\"-1\" value=\"0\" class=\"content__number form__output\"><span>kg</span>\r\n                                                </p>\r\n                                              </div>\r\n                                            </dd>\r\n                                          </dl>\r\n                                        </div>\r\n                                      </div>\r\n                                      <div class=\"article__content-w40\"><img src=\"/assets/images/products/semi_order/34/img_step3_01.jpg\" class=\"js-modal--image\"></div>\r\n                                    </div>\r\n                                    <div class=\"l-article--column-1\">\r\n                                      <div class=\"article__content\">\r\n                                        <ul class=\"c-list--sm-note\">\r\n                                          <li class=\"list__item\">ご注文は外寸法でのご指定になります。奥行を入力する際は、台高さの30mmを足した寸法を入力して下さい。ケース内部の飾るスペースは入力欄右の内寸で表示されます。</li>\r\n                                          <li class=\"list__item\">ネジ穴の位置について<br>基本は額の長辺側に各2ヶ所ずつとなります。額の縦と横が共に500mmを超えると、全ての辺に2ヶ所ずつとなります。</li>\r\n                                        </ul>\r\n                                      </div>\r\n                                    </div>\r\n                                  </section>\r\n                                  <!--step 4-->\r\n                                  <section id=\"step-04\" class=\"l-article--column-1 c-flame--xs-semiorder\">\r\n                                    <h3 class=\"c-heading--md\">\r\n                                      <p class=\"heading__sub--before c-label--lg-primary\">STEP 4</p>内容の確認\r\n                                    </h3>\r\n                                    <div class=\"l-article--column-1-center\">\r\n                                      <div class=\"article__content\">\r\n                                        <p class=\"c-text--md-danger\">寸法入力は全てmm(ミリ)単位です。<br>ご注文後の単位間違いによる交換はいたしませんので、入力した内容は必ずご確認ください。</p>\r\n                                        <p>数量・金額を確認後、「カートに入れる」ボタンをクリックして下さい。</p>\r\n                                      </div>\r\n                                    </div>\r\n                                  </section>\r\n                                </div>\r\n                              </div>\r\n                              {%revision_history%}\r\n                            </div>\r\n                          </div>\r\n                        </form>\r\n\r\n    <script>\r\n      window.onload = function() {\r\n        global_weight();\r\n        form_reset();\r\n        calculation();\r\n      };\r\n      \r\n    </script>','2019-07-25 21:27:06','2026-06-18 02:57:01'),(28,309,'<form action=\"/cgibin/cart-n/ex/cart.cgi\" method=\"post\" name=\"form_semiorder\" id=\"form_semiorder\" onsubmit=\"return false;\" class=\"p-overview--semiorder c-form js-scrollFixed\">\r\n                          <!-- デフォルトパラメーター-->\r\n                          <div>\r\n                            <script type=\"text/javascript\">document.write(\'<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"url\" id=\"url\" value=\"\' + location.href + \'\" />\');</script>\r\n                            <input id=\"itemno\" type=\"HIDDEN\" name=\"itemno\" value=\"semi_rittai\">\r\n                            <input id=\"itemna\" type=\"HIDDEN\" name=\"itemna\" value=\"油彩キャンバス立体額Fタイプ・セミオーダー\">\r\n                            <input id=\"opt1\" name=\"opt1\" type=\"HIDDEN\" value=\"\">\r\n                            <input id=\"opt2\" name=\"opt2\" type=\"HIDDEN\" value=\"\">\r\n                            <input id=\"opt3\" name=\"opt3\" type=\"HIDDEN\" value=\"\">\r\n                            <input id=\"opt4\" name=\"opt4\" type=\"HIDDEN\" value=\"\">\r\n                            <input id=\"opt5\" name=\"opt5\" type=\"HIDDEN\" value=\"\">\r\n                            <input id=\"sipri\" type=\"hidden\" name=\"sipri\" value=\"::0\">\r\n                            <input id=\"suryo\" name=\"suryo\" type=\"HIDDEN\" value=\"\">\r\n                            <script type=\"text/javascript\">document.write(\'<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"url\" id=\"url\" value=\"\' + location.href + \'\" />\');</script>\r\n                            <input id=\"itemno\" name=\"itemno\" type=\"HIDDEN\" value=\"TBH\">\r\n                            <input id=\"itemna\" name=\"itemna\" type=\"HIDDEN\" value=\"\">\r\n                            <input id=\"suryo\" name=\"suryo\" type=\"HIDDEN\" value=\"\">\r\n                            <input id=\"sipri\" type=\"HIDDEN\" name=\"sipri\" value=\"::0\">\r\n                            <script type=\"text/javascript\">document.write(\'<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"url\" id=\"url\" value=\"\' + location.href + \'\" />\');</script>\r\n                            <input id=\"itemno\" name=\"itemno\" type=\"HIDDEN\" value=\"EPH\">\r\n                            <input id=\"itemna\" name=\"itemna\" type=\"HIDDEN\" value=\"\">\r\n                            <input id=\"suryo\" name=\"suryo\" type=\"HIDDEN\" value=\"\">\r\n                            <input id=\"sipri\" type=\"HIDDEN\" name=\"sipri\" value=\"::0\">\r\n                          </div>\r\n                          <!-- 商品情報パート-->\r\n                          <div data-type=\"right\" class=\"overview__information js-scrollFixed__target\">\r\n                            {%product_title%}\r\n                            <div id=\"purchase\" class=\"js-products__semiorder\">\r\n                              <!-- 購入フロー-->\r\n                                                <div class=\"overview__flow c-flow js-flow__navigation\">\r\n                                                  <div class=\"flow__step js-flow__step\"><a href=\"#step-01\" class=\"js-dropdown js-anchorScroll\">\r\n                                                      <div class=\"js-dropdown__trigger\">\r\n                                                        <p class=\"flow__balloon c-window--balloon-b js-dropdown__content\">お届け先</p>\r\n                                                      </div></a><a href=\"#step-02\" class=\"js-dropdown js-anchorScroll\">\r\n                                                      <div class=\"js-dropdown__trigger\">\r\n                                                        <p class=\"flow__balloon c-window--balloon-b js-dropdown__content\">色</p>\r\n                                                      </div></a><a href=\"#step-03\" class=\"js-dropdown js-anchorScroll\">\r\n                                                      <div class=\"js-dropdown__trigger\">\r\n                                                        <p class=\"flow__balloon c-window--balloon-b js-dropdown__content\">形状</p>\r\n                                                      </div></a><a href=\"#step-04\" class=\"js-dropdown js-anchorScroll\">\r\n                                                      <div class=\"js-dropdown__trigger\">\r\n                                                        <p class=\"flow__balloon c-window--balloon-b js-dropdown__content\">サイズ</p>\r\n                                                      </div></a><a href=\"#step-05\" class=\"js-dropdown js-anchorScroll\">\r\n                                                      <div class=\"js-dropdown__trigger\">\r\n                                                        <p class=\"flow__balloon c-window--balloon-b js-dropdown__content\">確認</p>\r\n                                                      </div></a>\r\n                                                  </div>\r\n                                                  <div class=\"flow__progress js-flow__progress\"></div>\r\n                                                </div>\r\n                              <!-- フォーム-->\r\n                              <div class=\"overview__form\">\r\n                                <dl class=\"form__item form__num\">\r\n                                  <dt>数量:</dt>\r\n                                  <dd><span class=\"form__number\">\r\n                                      <button type=\"button\" class=\"number__button--plus c-button--md-white\"><i class=\"c-icon--plus\"></i></button>\r\n                                      <input name=\"suu\" type=\"text\" id=\"suu\" onChange=\"calculate(); global_weight();\" maxlength=\"4\" data-max=\"9999\" data-min=\"1\" placeholder=\"1\" value=\"1\">\r\n                                      <button type=\"button\" class=\"number__button--minus c-button--md-white\"><i class=\"c-icon--minus\"></i></button><span class=\"form__effect\"></span></span></dd>\r\n                                </dl>\r\n                              </div>\r\n                              <!-- 金額-->\r\n                              <div class=\"overview__price\">\r\n                                <dl class=\"price__item\">\r\n                                  <dt>単価:</dt>\r\n                                  <dd>\r\n                                    <input name=\"price\" type=\"text\" id=\"price\" onChange=\"calculate();\" maxlength=\"8\" readonly tabindex=\"-1\" value=\"0\" class=\"c-price--md\"><span>円（税抜）</span>\r\n                                  </dd>\r\n                                </dl>\r\n                                <dl class=\"price__item\">\r\n                                  <dt>合計:</dt>\r\n                                  <dd>\r\n                                    <input name=\"total\" type=\"text\" id=\"total\" onChange=\"calculate();\" maxlength=\"8\" readonly tabindex=\"-1\" value=\"0\" class=\"c-price--md js-products__price\"><span>円（税抜）</span>\r\n                                  </dd>\r\n                                </dl>\r\n                                <dl class=\"price__item\">\r\n                                  <dt></dt>\r\n                                  <dd>\r\n                                    <input name=\"total_price_tax\" type=\"text\" id=\"total_price_tax\" onchange=\"calculation()\" maxlength=\"8\" readonly tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"c-price--lg js-products__price\"><span>円（税込）</span>\r\n                                  </dd>\r\n                                </dl>\r\n                              </div>\r\n                              <!-- 購入情報-->\r\n                              <div class=\"overview__order\">\r\n                                <!--\r\n                                dl.order__item\r\n                                  dt 定価:\r\n                                  dd 1,000円\r\n                                dl.order__item\r\n                                  dt.c-text--sm-danger 割引額（率）:\r\n                                  dd.c-text--sm-danger 1,000円（90%）\r\n                                -->\r\n                                {%delivery_schedule%}\r\n                                                    <div id=\"global\" class=\"js-modal\">\r\n                                                      <dl class=\"order__item\">\r\n                                                        <dt><a data-target=\"oogataDetail\" class=\"c-label--md-oogata js-modal__trigger--open\">大型便</a>\r\n                                                          <div id=\"oogataDetail\" class=\"c-window--md js-modal__content\">\r\n                                                            <p class=\"c-heading--md\">大型便について</p>\r\n                                                            <p>運送上の都合で製品サイズが 「長辺+短辺+厚さ＝1400mm以上」の場合、代金引換と到着時間の指定はご利用頂けません。<br>予めご了承下さい。</p>\r\n                                                          </div>\r\n                                                        </dt>\r\n                                                      </dl>\r\n                                                      <div id=\"oogata\"></div>\r\n                                                    </div>\r\n                                <div id=\"haisou\" class=\"js-modal\">\r\n                                  <dl id=\"kojin_deliver\" class=\"order__item\">\r\n                                    <dt><a data-target=\"kojinDetail\" class=\"c-label--md-kojin js-modal__trigger--open\">個人宅配送料</a>\r\n                                      <div id=\"kojinDetail\" class=\"c-window--md js-modal__content\">\r\n                                        <p class=\"c-heading--md\">個人宅配送料について</p>\r\n                                        <p>製品サイズの幅・奥行・高さ（又は、縦・横）の合計が1750mmを超えるサイズで、お届け先が個人宅の場合、基本料金とは別に加算されます。</p>\r\n                                      </div>\r\n                                    </dt>\r\n                                    <dd><span id=\"haisou_price\"></span>円（税抜）\r\n                                      <input id=\"haisou_cost\" type=\"hidden\" name=\"haisou_cost\" value=\"\" class=\"js-products__haisou u-display--none\">\r\n                                    </dd>\r\n                                  </dl>\r\n                                  <dl id=\"area_deliver\" class=\"order__item\">\r\n                                    <dt><a data-target=\"enpouDetail\" class=\"c-label--md-enpou js-modal__trigger--open\">遠方配送料</a>\r\n                                      {%enpou_parts%}\r\n                                    </dt>\r\n                                    <dd><span id=\"area_price\"></span>円（税抜）本州除く\r\n                                      <input id=\"area_cost\" type=\"hidden\" name=\"area_cost\" value=\"\" class=\"js-products__haisou u-display--none\">\r\n                                    </dd>\r\n                                  </dl>\r\n                                </div>\r\n                                <div class=\"order__action\">\r\n                                  <button type=\"button\" onclick=\"form_submit()\" class=\"action__button c-button--xl-cart\"><i class=\"button__icon--before\"><img src=\"/assets/images/icon/icon_cart_w.svg\"></i>カートに入れる</button>\r\n                                </div>\r\n                              </div>\r\n                              {%relation_link%}\r\n                              <!-- スマホ用-->\r\n                                                <div class=\"overview__fixed\">\r\n                                                  <div class=\"fixed__flow c-flow js-flow__navigation is-clone\">\r\n                                                    <div class=\"flow__step js-flow__step\"><a href=\"#step-01\" class=\"js-dropdown js-anchorScroll\">\r\n                                              