               </div>\r\n                                            </dd>\r\n                                          </dl>\r\n                                          <dl class=\"section__set\">\r\n                                            <dt class=\"set__item\">全体短辺</dt>\r\n                                            <dd class=\"set__content\">\r\n                                              <div class=\"content__unit\">\r\n                                                <p class=\"unit__inline\">\r\n                                                  <input name=\"outside_height\" type=\"text\" id=\"outside_height\" maxlength=\"4\" readonly tabindex=\"-1\" value=\"0\" class=\"content__number form__output\"><span>mm</span>\r\n                                                </p>\r\n                                              </div>\r\n                                            </dd>\r\n                                          </dl>\r\n                                          <dl class=\"section__set\">\r\n                                            <dt class=\"set__item\">全体奥行</dt>\r\n                                            <dd class=\"set__content\">\r\n                                              <div class=\"content__unit\">\r\n                                                <p class=\"unit__inline\">\r\n                                                  <input name=\"outside_depth\" type=\"text\" id=\"outside_depth\" maxlength=\"4\" readonly tabindex=\"-1\" value=\"0\" class=\"content__number form__output\"><span>mm</span>\r\n                                                </p>\r\n                                              </div>\r\n                                            </dd>\r\n                                          </dl>\r\n                                          <dl class=\"section__set\">\r\n                                            <dt class=\"set__item\">全体重量</dt>\r\n                                            <dd class=\"set__content\">\r\n                                              <div class=\"content__unit\">\r\n                                                <p class=\"unit__inline\">\r\n                                                  <input name=\"weight\" type=\"text\" id=\"weight\" maxlength=\"4\" readonly tabindex=\"-1\" value=\"0\" class=\"content__number form__output\"><span>kg</span>\r\n                                                </p>\r\n                                              </div>\r\n                                            </dd>\r\n                                          </dl>\r\n                                        </div>\r\n                                      </div>\r\n                                      <div class=\"article__content-w50\">\r\n                                        <img src=\"/assets/images/products/semi_order/35/img_step3_01.jpg\" class=\"js-modal--image\" id=\"img_normal\">\r\n                                        <img src=\"/assets/images/products/semi_order/35/img_step3_02.jpg\" class=\"js-modal--image\" id=\"img_tanoji\">\r\n                                      </div>\r\n                                    </div>\r\n                                  </section>\r\n                                  <!--step 5-->\r\n                                  <section id=\"step-05\" class=\"l-article--column-1 c-flame--xs-semiorder\">\r\n                                    <h3 class=\"c-heading--md\">\r\n                                      <p class=\"heading__sub--before c-label--lg-primary\">STEP 5</p>内容の確認\r\n                                    </h3>\r\n                                    <div class=\"l-article--column-1-center\">\r\n                                      <div class=\"article__content\">\r\n                                        <p class=\"c-text--md-danger\">寸法入力は全てmm(ミリ)単位です。<br>ご注文後の単位間違いによる交換はいたしませんので、入力した内容は必ずご確認ください。</p>\r\n                                        <p>数量・金額を確認後、「カートに入れる」ボタンをクリックして下さい。</p>\