              <li class=\"list__item\">最小サイズはX2、Y2共に10mm</li>\r\n                                                                    <li class=\"list__item\">ケースの縁から10mm以上内側が加工範囲(下側は縁まで加工可)</li>\r\n                                                                    <li class=\"list__item\">残る部分が極端に少ない場合は、お断りする場合や別途費用が必要になる場合が有ります。</li>\r\n                                                                  </ul>\r\n                                                                </div>\r\n                                                              </div>\r\n                                                            </div>\r\n                                                          </div>\r\n                                                        </div>\r\n                                                      </section>\r\n                                                    </div>\r\n                                                  </div>\r\n                                                  <div class=\"section__item l-article--column-1\">\r\n                                                    <div class=\"article__content js-accordion\"><a class=\"js-accordion__trigger\"><i class=\"c-icon--toggle\"></i>追加加工についての注意事項</a>\r\n                                                      <div class=\"js-accordion__content\">\r\n                                                        <div class=\"l-article--column-2\">\r\n                                                          <div class=\"article__content\"><img src=\"/assets/images/products/semi_order/37/img_option0_01.jpg\" class=\"js-modal--image\"></div>\r\n                                                          <div class=\"article__content\"><img src=\"/assets/images/products/semi_order/37/img_option0_02.jpg\" class=\"js-modal--image\"></div>\r\n                                                        </div>\r\n                                                        <div class=\"l-article--column-1\">\r\n                                                          <div class=\"article__content\">\r\n                                                            <ul class=\"c-list--disc\">\r\n                                                              <li class=\"list__item\">追加加工を指定すると、飾る物の電気配線を通す為の穴や角抜き・切り欠き、固定用の穴・通風口などを製作することができます。</li>\r\n                                                              <li class=\"list__item\">不要な場合には入力せずに、カートへボタンをクリックして精算にお進み下さい。</li>\r\n                                                            </ul>\r\n                                                          </div>\r\n                                                        </div>\r\n                                                      </div>\r\n                                                    </div>\r\n                                                  </div>\r\n                                                </section>\r\n                                                <!--step 10-->\r\n                                                <section id=\"step-10\" class=\"l-article--column-1 c-flame--xs-semiorder\">\r\n                                                  <h3 class=\"c-heading--md\">\r\n                                                    <p class=\"heading__sub--before c-label--lg-primary\">STEP 10</p>図面・内容の確認\r\n                                                  </h3>\r\n                                                  <div class=\"l-article--column-1-center\">\r\n                                                    <div class=\"article__content\">\r\n                                                      <div class=\"c-flame--xs-gray-column-2-vertical\">\r\n                                                        <div class=\"flame__content--w50\">\r\n                                                          <dl class=\"section__set\">\r\n                                                            <dt class=\"set__item u-width--100\">重量(ケース＋台)</dt>\r\n                                                            <dd class=\"set__content\">\r\n                                                              <div class=\"content__unit\">\r\n                                                                <p class=\"unit__inline\">\r\n                                                                  <input name=\"body_weight\" type=\"text\" id=\"body_weight\" maxlength=\"4\" tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"content__number form__output\"><span>kg</span>\r\n                                                                </p>\r\n                                                              </div>\r\n                                                            </dd>\r\n                                                          </dl>\r\n                                                          <ul class=\"c-list--note--xs\">\r\n                                                            <li class=\"list__item\">穴あけ、角抜き・切り欠きによる重量の軽減は反映されません。</li>\r\n                                                          </ul>\r\n                                                          <dl class=\"section__set\">\r\n                                                            <dt class=\"set__item u-width--100\">全体外寸幅</dt>\r\n                                                            <dd class=\"set__content\">\r\n                                                              <div class=\"content__unit\">\r\n                                                                <p class=\"unit__inline\">\r\n                                                                  <input name=\"out_width\" type=\"text\" id=\"out_width\" onchange=\"input_restriction(1)\" maxlength=\"3\" readonly=\"\" tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"content__number form__output\"><span>mm</span>\r\n                                                                </p>\r\n                                                              </div>\r\n                                                            </dd>\r\n                                                          </dl>\r\n                                                          <dl class=\"section__set\">\r\n                                                            <dt class=\"set__item u-width--100\">全体外寸奥行</dt>\r\n                                                            <dd class=\"set__content\">\r\n                                                              <div class=\"content__unit\">\r\n                                                                <p class=\"unit__inline\">\r\n                                                                  <input name=\"out_depth\" type=\"text\" id=\"out_depth\" onchange=\"input_restriction(1)\" maxlength=\"3\" readonly=\"\" tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"content__number form__output\"><span>mm</span>\r\n                                                                </p>\r\n                                                              </div>\r\n                                                            </dd>\r\n                                                          </dl>\r\n                                                          <dl class=\"section__set\">\r\n                                                            <dt class=\"set__item u-width--100\">全体外寸高さ</dt>\r\n                                                            <dd class=\"set__content\">\r\n                                                              <div class=\"content__unit\">\r\n                                                                <p class=\"unit__inline\">\r\n                                                                  <input name=\"out_height\" type=\"text\" id=\"out_height\" onchange=\"input_restriction(1)\" maxlength=\"3\" readonly=\"\" tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"content__number form__output\"><span>mm</span>\r\n                                                                </p>\r\n                                                              </div>\r\n                                                            </dd>\r\n                                                          </dl>\r\n                                                        </div>\r\n                                                        <div class=\"flame__content--w50\">\r\n                                                          <dl class=\"section__set\">\r\n                                                            <dt class=\"set__item u-width--100\">重量(台のみ)</dt>\r\n                                                            <dd class=\"set__content\">\r\n                                                              <div class=\"content__unit\">\r\n                                                                <p class=\"unit__inline\">\r\n                                                                  <input name=\"pedestal_weight\" type=\"text\" id=\"pedestal_weight\" maxlength=\"4\" tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"content__number form__output\"><span>kg</span>\r\n                                                                </p>\r\n                                                              </div>\r\n                                                            </dd>\r\n                                                          </dl>\r\n                                                          <dl class=\"section__set\">\r\n                                                            <dt class=\"set__item u-width--100\">全体内寸幅</dt>\r\n                                                            <dd class=\"set__content\">\r\n                                                              <div class=\"content__unit\">\r\n                                                                <p class=\"unit__inline\">\r\n                                                                  <input name=\"inside_width\" type=\"text\" id=\"inside_width\" onchange=\"input_restriction(1)\" maxlength=\"3\" readonly=\"\" tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"content__number form__output\"><span>mm</span>\r\n                                                                </p>\r\n                                                              </div>\r\n                                                            </dd>\r\n                                                          </dl>\r\n                                                          <dl class=\"section__set\">\r\n                                                            <dt class=\"set__item u-width--100\">全体内寸奥行</dt>\r\n                                                            <dd class=\"set__content\">\r\n                                                              <div class=\"content__unit\">\r\n                                                                <p class=\"unit__inline\">\r\n                                                                  <input name=\"inside_depth\" type=\"text\" id=\"inside_depth\" onchange=\"input_restriction(1)\" maxlength=\"3\" readonly=\"\" tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"content__number form__output\"><span>mm</span>\r\n                                                                </p>\r\n                                                              </div>\r\n                                                            </dd>\r\n                                                          </dl>\r\n                                                          <dl class=\"section__set\">\r\n                                                            <dt class=\"set__item u-width--100\">全体内寸高さ</dt>\r\n                                                            <dd class=\"set__content\">\r\n                                                              <div class=\"content__unit\">\r\n                                                                <p class=\"unit__inline\">\r\n                                                                  <input name=\"inside_height\" type=\"text\" id=\"inside_height\" onchange=\"input_restriction(1)\" maxlength=\"3\" readonly=\"\" tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"content__number form__output\"><span>mm</span>\r\n                                                                </p>\r\n                                                              </div>\r\n                                                            </dd>\r\n                                                          </dl>\r\n                                                        </div>\r\n                                                      </div>\r\n                                                    </div>\r\n                                                    <div class=\"article__content\">\r\n                                                      <p>入力した加工内容を図面で確認下さい。</p>\r\n                                                      <p class=\"c-text--md-danger\">寸法入力は全てmm(ミリ)単位です。<br>ご注文後の単位間違いによる交換はいたしませんので、入力した内容は必ずご確認ください。</p>\r\n                                                      <div class=\"c-flame--xs-gray-column-2-center\">\r\n                                                        <div class=\"flame__content\">\r\n                                                          <button type=\"button\" onClick=\"total_calculation(1)\" class=\"c-button--md-zumen u-width--100\">図面確認</button>\r\n                                                          <button type=\"button\" onClick=\"total_calculation(10)\" class=\"c-button--md-zumen u-width--100 u-margin--top-16 u-display--none-sm\">3D形状確認</button>\r\n                                                        </div>\r\n                                                        <div class=\"flame__content\">\r\n                                                          <p class=\"c-text--center\">\r\n                                                            <label class=\"form__checkbox c-text--md-weightBold\">\r\n                                                              <input name=\"drawing_check\" id=\"drawing_check\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"1\"><i class=\"checkbox__button\"></i>確認チェック\r\n                                                            </label>\r\n                                                          </p>\r\n                                                        </div>\r\n                                                      </div>\r\n                                                      <p>数量・金額を確認後、「カートに入れる」ボタンをクリックして下さい。</p>\r\n                                                    </div>\r\n                                                  </div>\r\n                                                </section>\r\n                                                <div class=\"l-article--column-1\">\r\n                                                  <button type=\"button\" onclick=\"Form_Reset()\" class=\"c-button--sm-gray\">入力内容を全てリセット</button>\r\n                                                </div>\r\n                                              </div>\r\n                                            </div>\r\n                                            <div class=\"detail__fullorder c-flame--xs-gray-column-2-vertical\">\r\n                                              <div class=\"flame__content\">\r\n                                                <p class=\"c-text--sm-weightBold\">セミオーダーでご希望の仕様が指定できない場合、フルオーダーにてお問い合わせ下さい。</p>\r\n                                              </div>\r\n                                              <div class=\"flame__content\"><a href=\"/full_order/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"c-button--sm-primary u-width--100\">詳細はこちら<i class=\"button__icon--after c-icon--arrow-r-white\"></i></a></div>\r\n                                            </div>\r\n                                            {%revision_history%}\r\n                                          </div>\r\n                                        </div>\r\n                                      </form>\r\n                                      \r\n                                      <script>\r\n                                        window.onload = function() {\r\n                                          global_weight();\r\n                                          Form_Reset();\r\n                                          C_color_thickness();\r\n                                          input_restriction();\r\n                                        };\r\n                                        \r\n                                      </script>','2019-07-25 21:29:43','2026-09-11 02:07:58'),(31,312,'<form method=\"post\" action=\"/cgibin/cart-n/ex/cart.cgi\" name=\"form_semiorder\" id=\"form_semiorder\" onsubmit=\"return false;\" class=\"p-overview--semiorder c-form js-scrollFixed\">\r\n                          <!-- デフォルトパラメーター-->\r\n                          <div>\r\n                            <script type=\"text/javascript\">document.write(\'<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"url\" id=\"url\" value=\"\' + location.href + \'\" />\');</script>\r\n                            <input id=\"itemno\" type=\"hidden\" name=\"itemno\" value=\"semi_ent\">\r\n                            <input id=\"itemna\" name=\"itemna\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"円柱アクリルケースセミオーダー\">\r\n                            <input id=\"opt1\" type=\"hidden\" name=\"opt1\" value=\"\">\r\n                            <input id=\"opt2\" type=\"hidden\" name=\"opt2\" value=\"\">\r\n                            <input id=\"opt3\" type=\"hidden\" name=\"opt3\" value=\"\">\r\n                            <input id=\"sipri\" type=\"hidden\" name=\"sipri\" value=\"::0\">\r\n                          </div>\r\n                          <!-- 商品情報パート-->\r\n                          <div data-type=\"right\" class=\"overview__information js-scrollFixed__target\">\r\n                            {%product_title%}\r\n                            <div id=\"purchase\" class=\"js-products__semiorder\">\r\n                              <!-- 購入フロー-->\r\n                                                <div class=\"overview__flow c-flow js-flow__navigation\">\r\n                                