)\" class=\"action__button c-button--xl-cart\"><i\r\n              class=\"button__icon--before\"><img src=\"/assets/images/icon/icon_cart_w.svg\"></i>カートに入れる</button>\r\n        </div>\r\n      </div>\r\n      {%relation_link%}\r\n      <!-- スマホ用-->\r\n      <div class=\"overview__fixed\">\r\n        <div class=\"fixed__flow c-flow js-flow__navigation is-clone\">\r\n          <div class=\"flow__step js-flow__step\"><a href=\"#step-01\" class=\"js-dropdown js-anchorScroll\">\r\n              <div class=\"js-dropdown__trigger\">\r\n                <p class=\"flow__balloon c-window--balloon-b js-dropdown__content\">サイズ</p>\r\n              </div>\r\n            </a><a href=\"#step-02\" class=\"js-dropdown js-anchorScroll\">\r\n              <div class=\"js-dropdown__trigger\">\r\n                <p class=\"flow__balloon c-window--balloon-b js-dropdown__content\">色</p>\r\n              </div>\r\n            </a><a href=\"#step-03\" class=\"js-dropdown js-anchorScroll\">\r\n              <div class=\"js-dropdown__trigger\">\r\n                <p class=\"flow__balloon c-window--balloon-b js-dropdown__content\">付属品</p>\r\n              </div>\r\n            </a><a href=\"#step-04\" class=\"js-dropdown js-anchorScroll\">\r\n              <div class=\"js-dropdown__trigger\">\r\n                <p class=\"flow__balloon c-window--balloon-b js-dropdown__content\">穴開け</p>\r\n              </div>\r\n            </a><a href=\"#step-05\" class=\"js-dropdown js-anchorScroll\">\r\n              <div class=\"js-dropdown__trigger\">\r\n                <p class=\"flow__balloon c-window--balloon-b js-dropdown__content\">確認</p>\r\n              </div>\r\n            </a>\r\n          </div>\r\n          <div class=\"flow__progress js-flow__progress\"></div>\r\n        </div>\r\n        <div class=\"fixed__price\"><span>合計: </span>\r\n          <p class=\"c-price--md js-products__comma\">0</p><span>円（税込）</span>\r\n        </div><a href=\"#purchase\" class=\"fixed__button c-button--md-cart js-anchorScroll\">数量・金額を確認</a>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n  <!-- 商品紹介パート-->\r\n  <div class=\"overview__promotion js-scrollFixed__standard\">\r\n    <div class=\"overview__mainVisual js-imageSwitch js-products__mainVisual\">\r\n      <div class=\"mainVisual__slider js-imageSwitch__target\">\r\n        <figure class=\"slider__item is-active\">\r\n          <div class=\"item__frame js-imageSwitch__item is-active\"><img\r\n              src=\"/storage/images/collection/kendon_case_hinadan_semi/kendon_case_hinadan_semi_1.jpg\"></div>\r\n          <figcaption class=\"item__caption c-text--sm-center\">写真は使用例です。写真のフィギュアは製品に含みません。（使用例 ： Lサイズ ツマミタイプ）\r\n          </figcaption>\r\n        </figure>\r\n        <figure class=\"slider__item\">\r\n          <div class=\"item__frame js-imageSwitch__item\"><img\r\n              src=\"/assets/images/products/semi_order/42/img_slider02.jpg\"></div>\r\n          <figcaption class=\"item__caption c-text--sm-center\">台に小物を飾ることで展示物が重ならず、スッキリとディスプレイ出来ます。</figcaption>\r\n        </figure>\r\n        <figure class=\"slider__item\">\r\n          <div class=\"item__frame js-imageSwitch__item\"><img\r\n              src=\"/assets/images/products/semi_order/42/img_slider03.jpg\"></div>\r\n          <figcaption class=\"item__caption c-text--sm-center\">ひなだんはケースと一体型。ケース内側の空間を無駄なくご利用出来ます。</figcaption>\r\n        </figure>\r\n        <figure class=\"slider__item\">\r\n          <div class=\"item__frame js-imageSwitch__item\"><img\r\n              src=\"/assets/images/products/semi_order/42/img_slider04.jpg\"></div>\r\n          <figcaption class=\"item__caption c-text--sm-center\">取り外し可能なひなだん。用途に合わせ、３段などのご使用も可能です。ひなだん設置例は<a\r\n              href=\"/assets/pdf/products/semi_order/42/pdf_42_01.pdf\" target=\"_black\">こちら</a>。</figcaption>\r\n        </figure>\r\n        <figure class=\"slider__item\">\r\n          <div class=\"item__frame js-imageSwitch__item\"><img\r\n              src=\"/assets/images/products/semi_order/42/img_slider05.jpg\"></div>\r\n          <figcaption class=\"item__caption c-text--sm-center\">穴開け加工を施し、照明を設置すれば、光る展示台としてご使用いただけます。（照明は取扱っておりません）\r\n          </figcaption>\r\n        </figure>\r\n        <figure class=\"slider__item\">\r\n          <div class=\"item__frame js-imageSwitch__item\"><img\r\n              src=\"/assets/images/products/semi_order/42/img_slider06.jpg\"></div>\r\n          <figcaption class=\"item__caption c-text--sm-center\">一般的なメタルラック、ユニットシェルフに無駄なくジャストサイズで収まります。<a\r\n              data-target=\"modal-01\" class=\"js-modal__trigger--open\">設置例1</a>\r\n            <div id=\"modal-01\" class=\"c-window--md js-modal__content\"><img\r\n                src=\"/assets/images/products/semi_order/42/img_slider08.jpg\"></div>。（ラックサイズ：幅900ｘ奥行450mm）\r\n          </figcaption>\r\n        </figure>\r\n        <figure class=\"slider__item\">\r\n          <div class=\"item__frame js-imageSwitch__item\"><img\r\n              src=\"/assets/images/products/semi_order/42/img_slider07.jpg\"></div>\r\n          <figcaption class=\"item__caption c-text--sm-center\">ラックの複数段に設置することで、様々なサイズのコレクションを効率よく収納出来ます。<a\r\n              data-target=\"modal-02\" class=\"js-modal__trigger--open\">設置例2</a>\r\n            <div id=\"modal-02\" class=\"c-window--md js-modal__content\"><img\r\n                src=\"/assets/images/products/semi_order/42/img_slider09.jpg\"></div>。\r\n          </figcaption>\r\n        </figure>\r\n        <figure class=\"slider__item\">\r\n          <div class=\"item__frame js-imageSwitch__item\">\r\n            <iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/wbFIIeIT-Ao\" frameborder=\"0\"\r\n              allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\r\n          </div>\r\n          <figcaption class=\"item__caption c-text--sm-center\">開閉方法</figcaption>\r\n        </figure>\r\n        <figure class=\"slider__item\">\r\n          <div class=\"item__frame js-imageSwitch__item\">\r\n            <iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/ZkLA8s0dOBA\" frameborder=\"0\"\r\n              allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\r\n          </div>\r\n          <figcaption class=\"item__caption c-text--sm-center\">組立動画</figcaption>\r\n        </figure>\r\n      </div>\r\n      <div class=\"mainVisual__description c-heading--sm-primary\">\r\n        けんどん式アクリルケースを有効に活用出来る「ひなだん」付きケースタイプ。<br>ケースとひなだんを組み合わせることにより、内部の空間を無駄なく活用出来ます。<br>サイズは一般的なメタルラック、ユニットシェルフに収まる2種類をご用意しました。\r\n      </div>\r\n      <div class=\"mainVisual__anchor\"><a href=\"#spec\" class=\"anchor__button c-button--md-gray js-anchorScroll\">製品仕様<i\r\n            class=\"button__icon--after c-icon--arrow-b\"></i></a><a href=\"#input\"\r\n          class=\"anchor__button c-button--md-gray js-anchorScroll\">お見積・ご注文入力<i\r\n            class=\"button__icon--after c-icon--arrow-b\"></i></a></div>\r\n    </div>{%product_feature%}\r\n    <div class=\"overview__detail\">\r\n      <div id=\"spec\" class=\"detail__section js-flow\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"c-heading--lg-border\">製品仕様</h2>\r\n        <div class=\"l-article--column-1\">\r\n          <div class=\"article__content\">\r\n            <table class=\"c-table\">\r\n              <tbody>\r\n                <tr>\r\n                  <th>外寸サイズ</th>\r\n                  <td>Sサイズ：幅380x奥行380x高さ450mm<br>Ｌサイズ：幅790x奥行380x高さ450mm</td>\r\n                </tr>\r\n                <tr>\r\n                  <th>素材　厚さ</th>\r\n                  <td>アクリル　5mm厚</td>\r\n                </tr>\r\n                <tr>\r\n                  <th>構造　仕上</th>\r\n                  <td>本体：５面体の接着構造<br>扉：けんどん式<br>ひなだん：脱着構造</td>\r\n                </tr>\r\n                <tr>\r\n                  <th>付属品</th>\r\n                  <td>鍵２個（鍵タイプの場合）</td>\r\n                </tr>\r\n                <tr>\r\n                  <th>穴開け加工</th>\r\n                  <td>直径30mm。</td>\r\n                </tr>\r\n              </tbody>\r\n            </table>\r\n          </div>\r\n          <div class=\"article__content\"><a href=\"/assets/pdf/products/semi_order/42/pdf_42_02.pdf\" target=\"_blank\"\r\n              class=\"c-button--sm-gray\">組立方法</a></div>\r\n        </div>\r\n      </div>\r\n      <div id=\"input\" class=\"detail__section js-flow\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"c-heading--lg-border\">お見積・ご注文入力</h2>\r\n        <div class=\"js-flow__target\">\r\n          <!--step 1-->\r\n          <section id=\"step-01\" class=\"l-article--column-1 c-flame--xs-semiorder\">\r\n            <h3 class=\"c-heading--md\">\r\n              <p class=\"heading__sub--before c-label--lg-primary\">STEP 1</p>飾る物のサイズを選択\r\n            </h3>\r\n            <div class=\"l-article--column-2-reverse-center\">\r\n              <div class=\"article__content-w60\">\r\n                <div class=\"c-flame--xs-gray\">\r\n                  <dl class=\"section__set\">\r\n                    <dt class=\"set__item\">大きさ </dt>\r\n                    <dd class=\"set__content\">\r\n                      <div class=\"form__select u-width--100\">\r\n                        <select name=\"body_size\" id=\"body_size\" onchange=\"calculation()\">\r\n                          <option value=\"380\" selected=\"\">Sサイズ</option>\r\n                          <option value=\"790\">Lサイズ</option>\r\n                        </select>\r\n                      </div>\r\n                    </dd>\r\n                  </dl>\r\n                </div>\r\n                <div class=\"c-flame--xs-gray\">\r\n                  <dl class=\"section__set\">\r\n                    <dt class=\"set__item\">厚み</dt>\r\n                    <dd class=\"set__content\">\r\n                      <div class=\"content__unit\">\r\n                        <p class=\"unit__inline\"><b class=\"content__number\">5</b><span>mm</span></p>\r\n                      </div>\r\n                    </dd>\r\n                  </dl>\r\n                  <dl class=\"section__set\">\r\n                    <dt class=\"set__item\">内寸幅</dt>\r\n                    <dd class=\"set__content\">\r\n                      <div class=\"content__unit\">\r\n                        <p class=\"unit__inline\">\r\n                          <input name=\"inside_width\" type=\"text\" id=\"inside_width\" maxlength=\"4\"\r\n                            class=\"content__number form__output\"><span>mm</span>\r\n                        </p>\r\n                      </div>\r\n                    </dd>\r\n                  </dl>\r\n                  <dl class=\"section__set\">\r\n                    <dt class=\"set__item\">内寸奥行</dt>\r\n                    <dd class=\"set__content\">\r\n                      <div class=\"content__unit\">\r\n                        <p class=\"unit__inline\">\r\n                          <input name=\"inside_depth\" type=\"text\" id=\"inside_depth\" maxlength=\"3\"\r\n                            class=\"content__number form__output\"><span>mm</span>\r\n                        </p>\r\n                      </div>\r\n                    </dd>\r\n                  </dl>\r\n                  <dl class=\"section__set\">\r\n                    <dt class=\"set__item\">内寸高さ</dt>\r\n                    <dd class=\"set__content\">\r\n                      <div class=\"content__unit\">\r\n                        <p class=\"unit__inline\">\r\n                          <input name=\"inside_height\" type=\"text\" id=\"inside_height\" maxlength=\"3\"\r\n                            class=\"content__number form__output\"><span>mm</span>\r\n                        </p>\r\n                      </div>\r\n                    </dd>\r\n                  </dl>\r\n                </div>\r\n              </div>\r\n              <div class=\"article__content-w40\"><img src=\"/assets/images/products/semi_order/42/img_step1_01.jpg\"\r\n                  class=\"js-modal--image\"></div>\r\n            </div>\r\n            <div class=\"l-article--column-1\">\r\n         