                             <div class=\"article__content\">\r\n                                        <p class=\"c-text--sm-note\">彫刻は英字で「月 日, 年」の順番になります。詳細はレイアウトにてご確認下さい。</p>\r\n                                      </div>\r\n                                    </div>\r\n                                  </section>\r\n                                  <!--step 2-->\r\n                                  <section id=\"step-02\" class=\"l-article--column-1 c-flame--xs-semiorder\">\r\n                                    <h3 class=\"c-heading--md\">\r\n                                      <p class=\"heading__sub--before c-label--lg-primary\">STEP 2</p>用途を選択\r\n                                    </h3>\r\n                                    <div class=\"l-article--column-1\">\r\n                                      <div class=\"article__content\">\r\n                                        <div class=\"c-flame--xs-gray\">\r\n                                          <dl class=\"section__set\">\r\n                                            <dt class=\"set__item\">用途  </dt>\r\n                                            <dd class=\"set__content\">\r\n                                              <div class=\"form__select u-width--100\">\r\n                                                <select name=\"use\" id=\"use\" onchange=\"SetSipri(\'2\')\">\r\n                                                  <option value=\"Wedding Ceremony （結婚式）\" selected=\"\">Wedding Ceremony （結婚式）</option>\r\n                                                  <option value=\"Wedding Reception （披露宴）\">Wedding Reception （披露宴）</option>\r\n                                                </select>\r\n                                              </div>\r\n                                            </dd>\r\n                                          </dl>\r\n                                        </div>\r\n                                      </div>\r\n                                    </div>\r\n                                  </section>\r\n                                  <!--step 3-->\r\n                                  <section id=\"step-03\" class=\"l-article--column-1 c-flame--xs-semiorder\">\r\n                                    <h3 class=\"c-heading--md\">\r\n                                      <p class=\"heading__sub--before c-label--lg-primary\">STEP 3</p>名前を入力\r\n                                    </h3>\r\n                                    <div class=\"l-article--column-1\">\r\n                                      <div class=\"article__content\">\r\n                                        <div class=\"c-flame--xs-gray\">\r\n                                          <dl class=\"section__set\">\r\n                                            <dt class=\"set__item\">新郎様  </dt>\r\n                                            <dd class=\"set__content\">\r\n                                              <div class=\"content__unit\">\r\n                                                <p class=\"unit__inline\">\r\n                                                  <input name=\"bridegroom\" type=\"text\" id=\"bridegroom\" maxlength=\"20\" onchange=\"SetSipri(\'2\')\" class=\"u-width--100\">\r\n                                                </p>\r\n                                              </div>\r\n                                            </dd>\r\n                                          </dl>\r\n                                          <dl class=\"section__set\">\r\n                                            <dt class=\"set__item\">新婦様  </dt>\r\n                                            <dd class=\"set__content\">\r\n                                              <div class=\"content__unit\">\r\n                                                <p class=\"unit__inline\">\r\n                                                  <input name=\"bride\" type=\"text\" id=\"bride\" maxlength=\"20\" onchange=\"SetSipri(\'2\')\" class=\"u-width--100\">\r\n                                                </p>\r\n                                              </div>\r\n                                            </dd>\r\n                                          </dl>\r\n                                        </div>\r\n                                      </div>\r\n                                      <div class=\"article__content\">\r\n                                        <ul class=\"c-list--sm-note\">\r\n                                          <li class=\"list__item\">半角英字で入力下さい。</li>\r\n                                          <li class=\"list__item\">頭文字のみ大文字になります（他は小文字）。</li>\r\n                                          <li class=\"list__item\">名前のみ（苗字は入りません）。</li>\r\n                                        </ul>\r\n                                      </div>\r\n                                    </div>\r\n                                  </section>\r\n                                  <!--step 4-->\r\n                                  <section id=\"step-04\" class=\"l-article--column-1 c-flame--xs-semiorder\">\r\n                                    <h3 class=\"c-heading--md\">\r\n                                      <p class=\"heading__sub--before c-label--lg-primary\">STEP 4</p>内容の確認\r\n                                    </h3>\r\n                                    <div class=\"l-article--column-1-center\">\r\n                                      <div class=\"article__content\">\r\n                                        <p class=\"c-text--md-danger\">寸法入力は全てmm(ミリ)単位です。<br>ご注文後の単位間違いによる交換はいたしませんので、入力した内容は必ずご確認ください。</p>\r\n                                        <p>数量・金額を確認後、「カートに入れる」ボタンをクリックして下さい。</p>\r\n                                      </div>\r\n                                    </div>\r\n                                  </section>\r\n                                </div>\r\n                              </div>\r\n                              <div class=\"detail__fullorder c-flame--xs-gray-column-2-vertical\">\r\n                                <div class=\"flame__content\">\r\n                                  <p class=\"c-text--sm-weightBold\">セミオーダーでご希望の仕様が指定できない場合、フルオーダーにてお問い合わせ下さい。</p>\r\n                                </div>\r\n                                <div class=\"flame__content\"><a href=\"/full_order/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"c-button--sm-primary u-width--100\">詳細はこちら<i class=\"button__icon--after c-icon--arrow-r-white\"></i></a></div>\r\n                              </div>\r\n                              {%revision_history%}\r\n                            </div>\r\n                          </div>\r\n                        </form>\r\n\r\n    <script>\r\n      window.onload = function() {\r\n        SetSipri(\'2\');\r\n      };\r\n      \r\n    </script>','2019-07-25 23:47:46','2024-02-16 02:18:36');
INSERT INTO `semi_order_html_contents` VALUES (47,328,'<form action=\"/cgibin/cart-n/ex/cart.cgi\" method=\"POST\" name=\"form3\" id=\"form3\" onsubmit=\"return false;\" class=\"p-overview--semiorder c-form js-scrollFixed\">\r\n                          <!-- デフォルトパラメーター-->\r\n                          <div>\r\n                            <script type=\"text/javascript\">document.write(\'<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"url\" id=\"url\" value=\"\' + location.href + \'\" />\');</script>\r\n                            <input id=\"itemno\" name=\"itemno\" type=\"HIDDEN\" value=\"OWB-H\">\r\n                            <input id=\"itemna\" type=\"HIDDEN\" name=\"itemna\" value=\"ウェルカムボード（ハート）（製品サイズ305x254mm）\">\r\n                            <input id=\"opt1\" type=\"HIDDEN\" name=\"opt1\">\r\n                            <input id=\"opt2\" type=\"HIDDEN\" name=\"opt2\">\r\n                            <input id=\"opt3\" type=\"HIDDEN\" name=\"opt3\">\r\n                            <input id=\"sipri\" type=\"HIDDEN\" name=\"sipri\" value=\"\">\r\n                          </div>\r\n                          <!-- 商品情報パート-->\r\n                          <div data-type=\"right\" class=\"overview__information js-scrollFixed__target\">\r\n                            {%product_title%}\r\n                            <div id=\"purchase\" class=\"js-products__semiorder\">\r\n                              <!-- 購入フロー-->\r\n                                                <div class=\"overview__flow c-flow js-flow__navigation\">\r\n                                                  <div class=\"flow__step js-flow__step\"><a href=\"#step-01\" class=\"js-dropdown js-anchorScroll\">\r\n                                                      <div class=\"js-dropdown__trigger\">\r\n                                                        <p class=\"flow__balloon c-window--balloon-b js-dropdown__content\">年月日</p>\r\n                                                      </div></a><a href=\"#step-02\" class=\"js-dropdown js-anchorScroll\">\r\n                                                      <div class=\"js-dropdown__trigger\">\r\n                                                        <p class=\"flow__balloon c-window--balloon-b js-dropdown__content\">用途</p>\r\n                                                      </div></a><a href=\"#step-03\" class=\"js-dropdown js-anchorScroll\">\r\n                                                      <div class=\"js-dropdown__trigger\">\r\n                                                        <p class=\"flow__balloon c-window--balloon-b js-dropdown__content\">名前</p>\r\n                                                      </div></a><a href=\"#step-04\" class=\"js-dropdown js-anchorScroll\">\r\n                                                      <div class=\"js-dropdown__trigger\">\r\n                                                        <p class=\"flow__balloon c-window--balloon-b js-dropdown__content\">確認</p>\r\n                                                      </div></a>\r\n                                                  </div>\r\n                                                  <div class=\"flow__progress js-flow__progress\"></div>\r\n                                                </div>\r\n                              <!-- フォーム-->\r\n                              <div class=\"overview__form\">\r\n                                <dl class=\"form__item form__num\">\r\n                                  <dt>数量:</dt>\r\n                                  <dd><span class=\"form__number\">\r\n                                      <button type=\"button\" class=\"number__button--plus c-button--md-white\"><i class=\"c-icon--plus\"></i></button>\r\n                                      <input name=\"suryo\" type=\"text\" id=\"suryo\" maxlength=\"4\" onchange=\"SetSipri(\'3\')\" data-max=\"9999\" data-min=\"1\" placeholder=\"1\" value=\"1\">\r\n                                      <button type=\"button\" class=\"number__button--minus c-button--md-white\"><i class=\"c-icon--minus\"></i></button><span class=\"form__effect\"></span></span></dd>\r\n                                </dl>\r\n                              </div>\r\n                              <!-- 金額-->\r\n                              <div class=\"overview__price\">\r\n                                <dl class=\"price__item\">\r\n                                  <dt>単価:</dt>\r\n                                  <dd>\r\n                                    <input name=\"price\" type=\"text\" id=\"price\" onChange=\"SetSipri(\'3\')\" maxlength=\"6\" readonly tabindex=\"-1\" value=\"0\" class=\"c-price--md\"><span>円（税抜）</span>\r\n                                  </dd>\r\n                                </dl>\r\n                                <dl class=\"price__item\">\r\n                                  <dt>合計:</dt>\r\n                                  <dd>\r\n                                    <input name=\"total\" type=\"text\" id=\"total\" onChange=\"SetSipri(\'3\')\" maxlength=\"6\" readonly tabindex=\"-1\" value=\"0\" class=\"c-price--md js-products__price\"><span>円（税抜）</span>\r\n                                  </dd>\r\n                                </dl>\r\n                                <dl class=\"price__item\">\r\n                                  <dt></dt>\r\n                                  <dd>\r\n                                    <input name=\"total_price_tax\" type=\"text\" id=\"total_price_tax\" onchange=\"calculation()\" maxlength=\"8\" readonly tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"c-price--lg js-products__price\"><span>円（税込）</span>\r\n                                  </dd>\r\n                                </dl>\r\n                              </div>\r\n                              <!-- 購入情報-->\r\n                              <div class=\"overview__order\">\r\n                                <!--\r\n                                dl.order__item\r\n                                  dt 定価:\r\n                                   dd 1,000円\r\n                                 dl.order__item\r\n                                   dt.c-text--sm-danger 割引額（率）:\r\n                                   dd.c-text--sm-danger 1,000円（90%）\r\n                                -->\r\n                                {%delivery_schedule%}\r\n                                <div class=\"order__action\">\r\n                                  <button type=\"button\" onclick=\"SubmitCheck(\'3\')\" class=\"action__button c-button--xl-cart\"><i class=\"button__icon--before\"><img src=\"/assets/images/icon/icon_cart_w.svg\"></i>カートに入れる</button>\r\n                                </div>\r\n                              </div>\r\n                              {%relation_link%}\r\n                              <!-- スマホ用-->\r\n                                                <div class=\"overview__fixed\">\r\n                                                  <div class=\"fixed__flow c-flow js-flow__navigation is-clone\">\r\n                                                    <div class=\"flow__step js-flow__step\"><a href=\"#step-01\" class=\"js-dropdown js-anchorScroll\">\r\n                                                        <div class=\"js-dropdown__trigger\">\r\n                                                          <p class=\"flow__balloon c-window--balloon-b js-dropdown__content\">年月日</p>\r\n                                                        </div></a><a href=\"#step-02\" class=\"js-dropdown js-anchorScroll\">\r\n                                                        <div class=\"js-dropdown__trigger\">\r\n                                                          <p class=\"flow__balloon c-window--balloon-b js-dropdown__content\">用途</p>\r\n                                                        </div></a><a href=\"#step-03\" class=\"js-dropdown js-anchorScroll\">\r\n                                                        <div class=\"js-dropdown__trigger\">\r\n                                                          <p class=\"flow__balloon c-window--balloon-b js-dropdown__content\">名前</p>\r\n                                                        </div></a><a href=\"#step-04\" class=\"js-dropdown js-anchorScroll\">\r\n                                                        <div class=\"js-dropdown__trigger\">\r\n                                                          <p class=\"flow__balloon c-window--balloon-b js-dropdown__content\">確認</p>\r\n                                                        </div></a>\r\n                                                    </div>\r\n                                                    <div class=\"flow__progress js-flow__progress\"></div>\r\n                                                  </div>\r\n                                                  <div class=\"fixed__price\"><span>合計: </span>\r\n                                                    <p class=\"c-price--md js-products__comma\">0</p><span>円（税込）</span>\r\n                                                  </div><a href=\"#purchase\" class=\"fixed__button c-button--md-cart js-anchorScroll\">数量・金額を確認</a>\r\n                                                </div>\r\n                            </div>\r\n                          </div>\r\n                          <!-- 商品紹介パート-->\r\n                          <div class=\"overview__promotion js-scrollFixed__standard\">\r\n                            <div class=\"overview__mainVisual js-imageSwitch js-products__mainVisual\">\r\n                              <div class=\"mainVisual__slider js-imageSwitch__target\">\r\n                                <figure class=\"slider__item is-active\">\r\n                                  <div class=\"item__frame js-imageSwitch__item is-active\"><img src=\"/storage/images/interior/welcome_board/welcome_board_18.jpg\"></div>\r\n                                </figure>\r\n                              </div>\r\n                              <div class=\"mainVisual__description c-heading--sm-primary\">深く迫力ある立体的な彫刻を施したおしゃれなアクリル製のウェルカムボード。<br>浮き上がった美しい彫刻が二人の特別な日を引き立てます。</div>\r\n                              <div class=\"mainVisual__anchor\"><a href=\"#spec\" class=\"anchor__button c-button--md-gray js-anchorScroll\">製品仕様<i class=\"button__icon--after c-icon--arrow-b\"></i></a><a href=\"#input\" class=\"anchor__button c-button--md-gray js-anchorScroll\">お見積・ご注文入力<i class=\"button__icon--after c-icon--arrow-b\"></i></a></div>\r\n                            </div>{%product_feature%}\r\n                            <div class=\"overview__detail\">\r\n                              <div class=\"detail__section js-flow\">\r\n                                <h2 class=\"c-heading--lg-border\">商品特長</h2>\r\n                                <div class=\"l-article--column-1\">\r\n                                  <div class=\"article__content\">\r\n                                    <ul class=\"article__content c-list--disc\">\r\n                                      <li class=\"list__item\">エッチングやレーザー加工では出せない、深く立体的な三次元彫刻が魅力です。</li>\r\n                                      <li class=\"list__item\">本体は重圧な10mm厚のアクリル板を使用し、外周45度の斜めカットが高級感を高めます。</li>\r\n                                      <li class=\"list__item\">厚さ15mmのアクリル板から削り出した専用スタンドが本体をしっかりと支えます。</li>\r\n                                      <li class=\"list__item\">日付・用途・新郎新婦名が入り、二人だけのオリジナルウェルカムボードが出来上がります。</li>\r\n                                      <li class=\"list__item\">卓上タイプなので、挙式後はお部屋のインテリアとしてご使用頂けます。</li>\r\n                                    </ul>\r\n                                  </div>\r\n                                </div>\r\n                              </div>\r\n                              <div id=\"spec\" class=\"detail__section js-flow\">\r\n                                <h2 class=\"c-heading--lg-border\">製品仕様</h2>\r\n                                <div class=\"l-article--column-1\">\r\n                                  <div class=\"article__content\">\r\n                                    <table class=\"c-table\">\r\n                                      <tbody>\r\n                                        <tr>\r\n                                          <th>彫刻</th>\r\n                                          <td>三次元彫刻（裏側から彫刻）</td>\r\n                                        </tr>\r\n                                        <tr>\r\n                                          <th>製品サイズ</th>\r\n                                          <td>305mm ｘ 254mm<br><a data-target=\"modal-01\" class=\"js-modal__trigger--open\"><i class=\"link__icon--before c-icon--triangle-r\"></i>寸法図面</a>\r\n                                            <div id=\"modal-01\" class=\"c-window--md js-modal__content\"><img src=\"/assets/images/products/semi_order/52_03/img_content01.jpg\"></div>\r\n                                          </td>\r\n                                        </tr>\r\n                                        <tr>\r\n                                          <th>素材(本体)</th>\r\n                                          <td>クリアー 10mm</td>\r\n                                        </tr>\r\n                                        <tr>\r\n                                          <th>重量</th>\r\n                                          <td>約920g</td>\r\n                                        </tr>\r\n                                        <tr>\r\n                                          <th>スタイル</th>\r\n                                          <td>卓上スタンド付属</td>\r\n                                        </tr>\r\n                                        <tr>\r\n                                          <th>包装</th>\r\n                                          <td>無地ダンボール</td>\r\n                                        </tr>\r\n                                        <tr>\r\n                                          <th>レイアウト</th>\r\n                                          <td><a data-target=\"modal-02\" class=\"js-modal__trigger--open\"><i class=\"link__icon--before c-icon--triangle-r\"></i>レイアウト</a>\r\n                                            <div id=\"modal-02\" class=\"c-window--md js-modal__content\"><img src=\"/assets/images/products/semi_order/52_03/img_content02.jpg\"></div>\r\n                                          </td>\r\n                                        </tr>\r\n                                        <tr>\r\n                                          <th>書体</th>\r\n                                          <td><a data-target=\"modal-03\" class=\"js-modal__trigger--open\"><i class=\"link__icon--before c-icon--triangle-r\"></i>書体確認</a>\r\n                                            <div id=\"modal-03\" class=\"c-window--md js-modal__content\"><img src=\"/assets/images/products/semi_order/52_03/img_content03.jpg\"></div>\r\n                                          </td>\r\n                                        </tr>\r\n                                        <tr>\r\n                                          <th>品番</th>\r\n                                          <td>OWB-H</td>\r\n                                        </tr>\r\n                                      </tbody>\r\n                                    </table>\r\n                                  </div>\r\n                                </div>\r\n                              </div>\r\n                              <div id=\"input\" class=\"detail__section js-flow\">\r\n                                <h2 class=\"c-heading--lg-border\">お見積・ご注文入力</h2>\r\n                                <div class=\"js-flow__target\">\r\n                                  <!--step 1-->\r\n                                  <section id=\"step-01\" class=\"l-article--column-1 c-flame--xs-semiorder\">\r\n                                    <h3 class=\"c-heading--md\">\r\n                                      <p class=\"heading__sub--before c-label--lg-primary\">STEP 1</p>年月日を選択\r\n                                    </h3>\r\n                                    <div class=\"l-article--column-1\">\r\n                                      <div class=\"article__content\">\r\n                                        <div class=\"c-flame--xs-gray\">\r\n                                          <dl class=\"section__set\">\r\n                                            <dt class=\"set__item\">MONTH  </dt>\r\n                                            <dd class=\"set__content\">\r\n                                              <div class=\"form__select u-width--100\">\r\n                                                <select name=\"month\" id=\"month\" onchange=\"SetSipri(\'3\')\">\r\n                                                  <option value=\"January\" selected=\"\">January(1月)</option>\r\n                                                  <option value=\"February\">February(2月)</option>\r\n                                                  <option value=\"March\">March(3月)</option>\r\n                                                  <option value=\"April\">April(4月)</option>\r\n                                                  <option value=\"May\">May(5月)</option>\r\n                                                  <option value=\"June\">June(6月)</option>\r\n                                                  <option value=\"July\">July(7月)</option>\r\n                                                  <option value=\"August\">August(8月)</option>\r\n                                                  <option value=\"September\">September(9月)</option>\r\n                                                  <option value=\"October\">October(10月)</option>\r\n                                                  <option value=\"November\">November(11月)</option>\r\n                                                  <option value=\"December\">December(12月)</option>\r\n                                                </select>\r\n                                              </div>\r\n                                            </dd>\r\n                                          </dl>\r\n                                          <dl class=\"section__set\">\r\n                                            <dt class=\"set__item\">DATE  </dt>\r\n                                            <dd class=\"set__content\">\r\n                                              <div class=\"form__select u-width--100\">\r\n                                                <select name=\"day\" id=\"day\" onchange=\"SetSipri(\'3\')\">\r\n                                                  <option value=\"1\" selected=\"\">1日</option>\r\n                                                  <option value=\"2\">2日</option>\r\n                                                  <option value=\"3\">3日</option>\r\n                                                  <option value=\"4\">4日</option>\r\n                                                  <option value=\"5\">5日</option>\r\n                                                  <option value=\"6\">6日</option>\r\n                                                  <option value=\"7\">7日</option>\r\n                                                  <option value=\"8\">8日</option>\r\n                                                  <option value=\"9\">9日</option>\r\n                                                  <option value=\"10\">10日</option>\r\n                                                  <option value=\"11\">11日</option>\r\n                                                  <option value=\"12\">12日</option>\r\n                                                  <option value=\"13\">13日</option>\r\n                                                  <option value=\"14\">14日</option>\r\n                                                  <option value=\"15\">15日</option>\r\n                                                  <option value=\"16\">16日</option>\r\n                                                  <option value=\"17\">17日</option>\r\n                                                  <option value=\"18\">18日</option>\r\n                                                  <option value=\"19\">19日</option>\r\n                                                  <option value=\"20\">20日</option>\r\n                                                  <option value=\"21\">21日</option>\r\n                                                  <option value=\"22\">22日</option>\r\n                                                  <option value=\"23\">23日</option>\r\n                                                  <option value=\"24\">24日</option>\r\n                                                  <option value=\"25\">25日</option>\r\n                                                  <option value=\"26\">26日</option>\r\n                                                  <option value=\"27\">27日</option>\r\n                                                  <option value=\"28\">28日</option>\r\n                                                  <option value=\"29\">29日</option>\r\n                                                  <option value=\"30\">30日</option>\r\n                                                  <option value=\"31\">31日</option>\r\n                                                </select>\r\n                                              </div>\r\n                                            </dd>\r\n                                          </dl>\r\n                                          <dl class=\"section__set\">\r\n                                            <dt class=\"set__item\">YEAR  </dt>\r\n                                            <dd class=\"set__content\">\r\n                                              <div class=\"content__unit\">\r\n                                                <p class=\"unit__inline\">\r\n                                                  <input name=\"year\" type=\"text\" id=\"year\" maxlength=\"4\" onchange=\"SetSipri(\'3\')\" class=\"u-width--100\">\r\n                                                </p>\r\n                                              </div>\r\n                                            </dd>\r\n                                          </dl>\r\n                                        </div>\r\n                                      </div>\r\n                                      <div class=\"article__content\">\r\n                                        <p class=\"c-text--sm-note\">彫刻は英字で「月 日, 年」の順番になります。詳細はレイアウトにてご確認下さい。</p>\r\n                                      </div>\r\n                                    </div>\r\n                                  </section>\r\n                                  <!--step 2-->\r\n                                  <section id=\"step-02\" class=\"l-article--column-1 c-flame--xs-semiorder\">\r\n                                    <h3 class=\"c-heading--md\">\r\n                                      <p class=\"heading__sub--before c-label--lg-primary\">STEP 2</p>用途を選択\r\n                                    </h3>\r\n                                    <div class=\"l-article--column-1\">\r\n                                      <div class=\"article__content\">\r\n                                        <div class=\"c-flame--xs-gray\">\r\n                                          <dl class=\"section__set\">\r\n                                            <dt class=\"set__item\">用途  </dt>\r\n                                            <dd class=\"set__content\">\r\n                                              <div class=\"form__select u-width--100\">\r\n                                                <select name=\"use\" id=\"use\" onchange=\"SetSipri(\'3\')\">\r\n                                                  <option value=\"Wedding Ceremony （結婚式）\" selected=\"\">Wedding Ceremony （結婚式）</option>\r\n                                                  <option value=\"Wedding Reception （披露宴）\">Wedding Reception （披露宴）</option>\r\n                                                </select>\r\n                                              </div>\r\n                                            </dd>\r\n                                          </dl>\r\n                                        </div>\r\n                                      </div>\r\n                                    </div>\r\n                                  </section>\r\n                                  <!--step 3-->\r\n                                  <section id=\"step-03\" class=\"l-article--column-1 c-flame--xs-semiorder\">\r\n                                    <h3 class=\"c-heading--md\">\r\n                                      <p class=\"heading__sub--before c-label--lg-primary\">STEP 3</p>名前を入力\r\n                                    </h3>\r\n                                    <div class=\"l-article--column-1\">\r\n                                      <div class=\"article__content\">\r\n                                        <div class=\"c-flame--xs-gray\">\r\n                                          <dl class=\"section__set\">\r\n                                            <dt class=\"set__item\">新郎様  </dt>\r\n                                            <dd class=\"set__content\">\r\n                                              <div class=\"content__unit\">\r\n                                                <p class=\"unit__inline\">\r\n                                                  <input name=\"bridegroom\" type=\"text\" id=\"bridegroom\" maxlength=\"20\" onchange=\"SetSipri(\'3\')\" class=\"u-width--100\">\r\n                                                </p>\r\n                                              </div>\r\n                                            </dd>\r\n                                          </dl>\r\n                                          <dl class=\"section__set\">\r\n                                            <dt class=\"set__item\">新婦様  </dt>\r\n                                            <dd class=\"set__content\">\r\n                                              <div class=\"content__unit\">\r\n                                                <p class=\"unit__inline\">\r\n                                                  <input name=\"bride\" type=\"text\" id=\"bride\" maxlength=\"20\" onchange=\"SetSipri(\'3\')\" class=\"u-width--100\">\r\n                                                </p>\r\n                                              </div>\r\n                                            </dd>\r\n                                          </dl>\r\n                                        </div>\r\n                                      </div>\r\n                                      <div class=\"article__content\">\r\n                                        <ul class=\"c-list--sm-note\">\r\n                                          <li class=\"list__item\">半角英字で入力下さい。</li>\r\n                                          <li class=\"list__item\">頭文字のみ大文字になります（他は小文字）。</li>\r\n                                          <li class=\"list__item\">名前のみ（苗字は入りません）。</li>\r\n                                        </ul>\r\n                                      </div>\r\n                                    </div>\r\n                                  </section>\r\n                                  <!--step 4-->\r\n                                  <section id=\"step-04\" class=\"l-article--column-1 c-flame--xs-semiorder\">\r\n                                    <h3 class=\"c-heading--md\">\r\n                                      <p class=\"heading__sub--before c-label--lg-primary\">STEP 4</p>内容の確認\r\n                                    </h3>\r\n                                    <div class=\"l-article--column-1-center\">\r\n                                      <div class=\"article__content\">\r\n                                        <p class=\"c-text--md-danger\">寸法入力は全てmm(ミリ)単位です。<br>ご注文後の単位間違いによる交換はいたしませんので、入力した内容は必ずご確認ください。</p>\r\n                                        <p>数量・金額を確認後、「カートに入れる」ボタンをクリックして下さい。</p>\r\n                                      </div>\r\n                                    </div>\r\n                                  </section>\r\n                                </div>\r\n                              </div>\r\n                              <div class=\"detail__fullorder c-flame--xs-gray-column-2-vertical\">\r\n                                <div class=\"flame__content\">\r\n                                  <p class=\"c-text--sm-weightBold\">セミオーダーでご希望の仕様が指定できない場合、フルオーダーにてお問い合わせ下さい。</p>\r\n                                </div>\r\n                                <div class=\"flame__content\"><a href=\"/full_order/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"c-button--sm-primary u-width--100\">詳細はこちら<i class=\"button__icon--after c-icon--arrow-r-white\"></i></a></div>\r\n                              </div>\r\n                              {%revision_history%}\r\n                            </div>\r\n                          </div>\r\n                        </form>\r\n\r\n    <script>\r\n      window.onload = function() {\r\n        SetSipri(\'3\');\r\n      };\r\n      \r\n    </script>','2019-07-25 23:48:33','2024-02-16 02:17:45'),(48,329,'<form method=\"post\" action=\"/cgibin/cart-n/ex/cart.cgi\" name=\"form_semiorder\" id=\"form_semiorder\" onsubmit=\"return false;\" class=\"p-overview--semiorder c-form js-scrollFixed\">\r\n                          <!-- デフォルトパラメーター-->\r\n                          <div>\r\n                            <script type=\"text/javascript\">document.write(\'<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"url\" id=\"url\" value=\"\' + location.href + \'\" />\');</script>\r\n                            <input id=\"itemno\" type=\"hidden\" name=\"itemno\" value=\"semi_rpc\">\r\n                            <input id=\"itemna\" name=\"itemna\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"レコードプレーヤーカバー\">\r\n                            <input id=\"opt1\" type=\"hidden\" name=\"opt1\" value=\"\">\r\n                            <input id=\"opt2\" type=\"hidden\" name=\"opt2\" value=\"\">\r\n                            <input id=\"opt3\" type=\"hidden\" name=\"opt3\" value=\"\">\r\n                            <input id=\"opt4\" type=\"hidden\" name=\"opt4\" value=\"\">\r\n                            <input id=\"opt5\" type=\"hidden\" name=\"opt5\" value=\"\">\r\n                            <input id=\"opt6\" type=\"hidden\" name=\"opt6\" value=\"\">\r\n                            <input id=\"opt7\" type=\"hidden\" name=\"opt7\" value=\"\">\r\n                            <input id=\"suryo\" name=\"suryo\" type=\"HIDDEN\" value=\"\">\r\n                            <input id=\"sipri\" type=\"hidden\" name=\"sipri\" value=\"::0\">\r\n                            <script type=\"text/javascript\">document.write(\'<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"url\" id=\"url\" value=\"\' + location.href + \'\" />\');</script>\r\n                            <input id=\"itemno\" name=\"itemno\" type=\"HIDDEN\" value=\"TBH\">\r\n                            <input id=\"itemna\" name=\"itemna\" type=\"HIDDEN\" value=\"\">\r\n                            <input id=\"suryo\" name=\"suryo\" type=\"HIDDEN\" value=\"\">\r\n                            <input id=\"sipri\" type=\"HIDDEN\" name=\"sipri\" value=\"::0\">\r\n                            <script type=\"text/javascript\">document.write(\'<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"url\" id=\"url\" value=\"\' + location.href + \'\" />\');</script>\r\n                            <input id=\"itemno\" name=\"itemno\" type=\"HIDDEN\" value=\"EPH\">\r\n                            <input id=\"itemna\" name=\"itemna\" type=\"HIDDEN\" value=\"\">\r\n                            <input id=\"suryo\" name=\"suryo\" type=\"HIDDEN\" value=\"\">\r\n                            <input id=\"sipri\" type=\"HIDDEN\" name=\"sipri\" value=\"::0\">\r\n                          </div>\r\n                          <!-- 商品情報パート-->\r\n                          <div data-type=\"right\" class=\"overview__information js-scrollFixed__target\">\r\n                            {%product_title%}\r\n                            <div id=\"purchase\" class=\"js-products__semiorder\">\r\n                              <!-- 購入フロー-->\r\n                                                <div class=\"overview__flow c-flow js-flow__navigation\">\r\n                                                  <div class=\"flow__step js-flow__step\"><a href=\"#step-01\" class=\"js-dropdown js-anchorScroll\">\r\n                                                      <div class=\"js-dropdown__trigger\">\r\n                                                        <p class=\"flow__balloon c-window--balloon-b js-dropdown__content\">お届け先</p>\r\n                                                      </div></a><a href=\"#step-02\" class=\"js-dropdown js-anchorScroll\">\r\n                                                      <div class=\"js-dropdown__trigger\">\r\n                                                        <p class=\"flow__balloon c-window--balloon-b js-dropdown__content\">色</p>\r\n                                                      </div></a><a href=\"#step-03\" class=\"js-dropdown js-anchorScroll\">\r\n                                                      <div class=\"js-dropdown__trigger\">\r\n                                                        <p class=\"flow__balloon c-window--balloon-b js-dropdown__content\">サイズ</p>\r\n                                                      </div></a><a href=\"#step-04\" class=\"js-dropdown js-anchorScroll\">\r\n                                                      <div class=\"js-dropdown__trigger\">\r\n                                                        <p class=\"flow__balloon c-window--balloon-b js-dropdown__content\">追加加工</p>\r\n                                                      </div></a><a href=\"#step-05\" class=\"js-dropdown js-anchorScroll\">\r\n                                                      <div class=\"js-dropdown__trigger\">\r\n                                                        <p class=\"flow__balloon c-window--balloon-b js-dropdown__content\">確認</p>\r\n                                                      </div></a>\r\n                                                  </div>\r\n                                                  <div class=\"flow__progress js-flow__progress\"></div>\r\n                                                </div>\r\n                              <!-- フォーム-->\r\n                              <div class=\"overview__form\">\r\n                                <dl class=\"form__item form__num\">\r\n                                  <dt>数量:</dt>\r\n                                  <dd><span class=\"form__number\">\r\n                                      <button type=\"button\" class=\"number__button--plus c-button--md-white\"><i class=\"c-icon--plus\"></i></button>\r\n                                      <input name=\"suu\" id=\"suu\" type=\"text\" onchange=\"calculation();global_weight();\" maxlength=\"3\" data-max=\"9999\" data-min=\"1\" placeholder=\"1\" value=\"1\">\r\n                                      <button type=\"button\" class=\"number__button--minus c-button--md-white\"><i class=\"c-icon--minus\"></i></button><span class=\"form__effect\"></span></span></dd>\r\n                                </dl>\r\n                              </div>\r\n                              <!-- 金額-->\r\n                              <div class=\"overview__price\">\r\n                                <dl class=\"price__item\">\r\n                                  <dt>単価:</dt>\r\n                                  <dd>\r\n                                    <input name=\"body_sale_price\" type=\"text\" id=\"body_sale_price\" onchange=\"calculation()\" maxlength=\"11\" tabindex=\"-1\" readonly=\"\" class=\"c-price--md\"><span>円（税抜）</span>\r\n                                  </dd>\r\n                                </dl>\r\n                                <dl class=\"price__item\">\r\n                                  <dt>合計:</dt>\r\n                                  <dd>\r\n                                    <input name=\"total_body_sale_price\" type=\"text\" id=\"total_body_sale_price\" onchange=\"calculation()\" maxlength=\"11\" tabindex=\"-1\" readonly=\"\" class=\"c-price--md js-products__price\"><span>円（税抜）</span>\r\n                                  </dd>\r\n                                </dl>\r\n                                <dl class=\"price__item\">\r\n                                  <dt></dt>\r\n                                  <dd>\r\n                                    <input name=\"total_price_tax\" type=\"text\" id=\"total_price_tax\" onchange=\"calculation()\" maxlength=\"8\" readonly tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"c-price--lg js-products__price\"><span>円（税込）</span>\r\n                                  </dd>\r\n                                </dl>\r\n                              </div>\r\n                              <!-- 購入情報-->\r\n                              <div class=\"overview__order\">\r\n                                {%delivery_schedule%}\r\n                                                    <div id=\"global\" class=\"js-modal\">\r\n                                                      <dl class=\"order__item\">\r\n                                                        <dt><a data-target=\"oogataDetail\" class=\"c-label--md-oogata js-modal__trigger--open\">大型便</a>\r\n                                                          <div id=\"oogataDetail\" class=\"c-window--md js-modal__content\">\r\n                                                            <p class=\"c-heading--md\">大型便について</p>\r\n                                                            <p>運送上の都合で製品サイズが 「幅＋奥行＋高さ＝1400mm以上」の場合、代金引換と到着時間の指定はご利用頂けません。<br>予めご了承下さい。</p>\r\n                                                          </div>\r\n                                                        </dt>\r\n                                                      </dl>\r\n                                                      <div id=\"oogata\"></div>\r\n                                                    </div>\r\n                                <div id=\"haisou\" class=\"js-modal\">\r\n                                  <dl id=\"kojin_deliver\" class=\"order__item\">\r\n                                    <dt><a data-target=\"kojinDetail\" class=\"c-label--md-kojin js-modal__trigger--open\">個人宅配送料</a>\r\n                                      <div id=\"kojinDetail\" class=\"c-window--md js-modal__content\">\r\n                                        <p class=\"c-heading--md\">個人宅配送料について</p>\r\n                                        <p>製品サイズの幅・奥行・高さ（又は、縦・横）の合計が1750mmを超えるサイズで、お届け先が個人宅の場合、基本料金とは別に加算されます。</p>\r\n                                      </div>\r\n                                    </dt>\r\n                                    <dd><span id=\"haisou_price\"></span>円（税抜）\r\n                                      <input id=\"haisou_cost\" type=\"hidden\" name=\"haisou_cost\" value=\"\" class=\"js-products__haisou u-display--none\">\r\n                                    </dd>\r\n                                  </dl>\r\n                                  <dl id=\"area_deliver\" class=\"order__item\">\r\n                                    <dt><a data-target=\"enpouDetail\" class=\"c-label--md-enpou js-modal__trigger--open\">遠方配送料</a>\r\n                                      {%enpou_parts%}\r\n                                    </dt>\r\n                                    <dd><span id=\"area_price\"></span>円（税抜）本州除く\r\n                                      <input id=\"area_cost\" type=\"hidden\" name=\"area_cost\" value=\"\" class=\"js-products__haisou u-display--none\">\r\n                                    </dd>\r\n                                  </dl>\r\n                                </div>\r\n                                <div class=\"order__action\">\r\n                                  <button type=\"button\" onclick=\"form_submit()\" class=\"action__button c-button--xl-cart\"><i class=\"button__icon--before\"><img src=\"/assets/images/icon/icon_cart_w.svg\"></i>カートに入れる</button>\r\n                                  <div class=\"action__draw\">\r\n                                    <button type=\"button\" onClick=\"zumen_kakunin(0)\" class=\"action__button c-button--md-zumen\">2D図面<i class=\"button__icon--after c-icon--arrow-r-white\"></i></button>\r\n                                    <button type=\"button\" onClick=\"zumen_kakunin(1)\" class=\"action__button c-button--md-zumen u-display--none-sm\">3D図面<i class=\"button__icon--after c-icon--arrow-r-white\"></i></button>\r\n                                  </div>\r\n                                </div>\r\n                              </div>\r\n                              {%relation_link%}\r\n                              <!-- スマホ用-->\r\n                                                <div class=\"overview__fixed\">\r\n                                                  <div class=\"fixed__flow c-flow js-flow__navigation is-clone\">\r\n                                                    <div class=\"flow__step js-flow__step\"><a href=\"#step-01\" class=\"js-dropdown js-anchorScroll\">\r\n                                                        <div class=\"js-dropdown__trigger\">\r\n                                                          <p class=\"flow__balloon c-window--balloon-b js-dropdown__content\">お届け先</p>\r\n                                                        </div></a><a href=\"#step-02\" class=\"js-dropdown js-anchorScroll\">\r\n                                                        <div class=\"js-dropdown__trigger\">\r\n                                                          <p class=\"flow__balloon c-window--balloon-b js-dropdown__content\">色</p>\r\n                                                        </div></a><a href=\"#step-03\" class=\"js-dropdown js-anchorScroll\">\r\n                                                        <div class=\"js-dropdown__trigger\">\r\n                                                          <p class=\"flow__balloon c-window--balloon-b js-dropdown__content\">サイズ</p>\r\n                                                        </div></a><a href=\"#step-04\" class=\"js-dropdown js-anchorScroll\">\r\n                                                        <div class=\"js-dropdown__trigger\">\r\n                                                          <p class=\"flow__balloon c-window--balloon-b js-dropdown__content\">追加加工</p>\r\n                                                        </div></a><a href=\"#step-05\" class=\"js-dropdown js-anchorScroll\">\r\n                                                        <div class=\"js-dropdown__trigger\">\r\n                                                          <p class=\"flow__balloon c-window--balloon-b js-dropdown__content\">確認</p>\r\n                                                        </div></a>\r\n                                                    </div>\r\n                                                    <div class=\"flow__progress js-flow__progress\"></div>\r\n                                                  </div>\r\n                                                  <div class=\"fixed__price\"><span>合計: </span>\r\n                                                    <p class=\"c-price--md js-products__comma\">0</p><span>円（税込）</span>\r\n                                                  </div><a href=\"#purchase\" class=\"fixed__button c-button--md-cart js-anchorScroll\">数量・金額を確認</a>\r\n                                                </div>\r\n                            </div>\r\n                          </div>\r\n                          <!-- 商品紹介パート-->\r\n                          <div class=\"overview__promotion js-scrollFixed__standard\">\r\n                            <div class=\"overview__mainVisual js-imageSwitch js-products__mainVisual\">\r\n                              <div class=\"mainVisual__slider js-imageSwitch__target\">\r\n                                <figure class=\"slider__item is-active\">\r\n                                  <div class=\"item__frame js-imageSwitch__item is-active\"><img src=\"/storage/images/interior/record_player_cover/record_player_cover_1.jpg\"></div>\r\n                                </figure>\r\n                              </div>\r\n                              <div class=\"mainVisual__description c-heading--sm-primary\">\r\n                                レコードプレーヤーにピッタリなサイズの高級感溢れるアクリル製ダストカバー。\r\n                                カバーが標準装着されていないプレーヤー、破損したカバーの代替品に最適です。\r\n                                ケーブル用の切欠き、ヒンジ固定穴などのオプションも同時に指定可能です。\r\n                              </div>\r\n                              <div class=\"mainVisual__anchor\"><a href=\"#spec\" class=\"anchor__button c-button--md-gray js-anchorScroll\">製品仕様<i class=\"button__icon--after c-icon--arrow-b\"></i></a><a href=\"#input\" class=\"anchor__button c-button--md-gray js-anchorScroll\">お見積・ご注文入力<i class=\"button__icon--after c-icon--arrow-b\"></i></a></div>\r\n                            </div>{%product_feature%}\r\n                            <div class=\"overview__detail\">\r\n                              <div class=\"detail__section js-flow\">\r\n                                <h2 class=\"c-heading--lg-border\">特徴</h2>\r\n                                <div class=\"l-article--column-1\">\r\n                                  <div class=\"article__content\">\r\n                                    <h3 class=\"c-heading--sm\">雰囲気に合わせて選べる4色のダストカバー</h3>\r\n                                    <div class=\"l-article--column-2\">\r\n                                      <div class=\"article__content\"><img src=\"/assets/images/products/semi_order/53/img_color_clear.jpg\" class=\"js-modal--image\"></div>\r\n                                      <div class=\"article__content\"><img src=\"/assets/images/products/semi_order/53/img_color_graySmoke.jpg\" class=\"js-modal--image\"></div>\r\n                                      <div class=\"article__content\"><img src=\"/assets/images/products/semi_order/53/img_color_brownSmoke.jpg\" class=\"js-modal--image\"></div>\r\n                                      <div class=\"article__content\"><img src=\"/assets/images/products/semi_order/53/img_color_glassEdge.jpg\" class=\"js-modal--image\"></div>\r\n                                    </div>\r\n                                  </div>\r\n                                  <div class=\"article__content\">\r\n                                    <ul class=\"c-list--sm-disc\">\r\n                                      <li class=\"list__item\">最高の透明度を誇るクリアー、プレーヤーの存在感を絶妙に隠すグレースモークとブラウンスモーク、高級感溢れるガラスエッジの4色からお選び頂けます。</li>\r\n                                      <li class=\"list__item\">プレーヤーの雰囲気に合わせたダストカバーができあがります。</li>\r\n                                    </ul>\r\n                                    <dl>\r\n                                      <dt class=\"c-text--sm\">使用例</dt>\r\n                                      <dd class=\"c-text--sm\">カバーサイズ：幅485 x 奥行380 x 高さ75mm（取手穴・ヒンジ・切欠きなし）</dd>\r\n                                      <dd class=\"c-text--sm\">カバー色：左上 - クリアー／右上 - グレースモーク／左下 - ブラスンスモーク／右下 - ガラスエッジ</dd>\r\n                                    </dl>\r\n                                  </div>\r\n                                </div>\r\n                                <div class=\"l-article--column-1\">\r\n                                  <div class=\"article__content\">\r\n                                    <h3 class=\"c-heading--sm\">美しい仕上げで高級感あるアクリルカバー</h3>\r\n                                    <div class=\"l-article--column-2\">\r\n                                      <div class=\"article__content\"><img src=\"/assets/images/products/semi_order/53/img_detail_01.jpg\" class=\"js-modal--image\"></div>\r\n                                      <div class=\"article__content\"><img src=\"/assets/images/products/semi_order/53/img_detail_02.jpg\" class=\"js-modal--image\"></div>\r\n                                    </div>\r\n                                  </div>\r\n                                  <div class=\"article__content\">\r\n                                    <ul class=\"c-list--sm-disc\">\r\n                                      <li class=\"list__item\">5mmのアクリル板を使用し、前後の上面2辺に丸みをつけた、おしゃれで高級感のあるカバーです。</li>\r\n                                      <li class=\"list__item\">アクリル板の厚みにあわせた透明の滑り止め付きで、カバーのズレを防止します。</li>\r\n                                    </ul>\r\n                                  </div>\r\n                                </div>\r\n                                <div class=\"l-article--column-1\">\r\n                                  <div class=\"article__content\">\r\n                                    <h3 class=\"c-heading--sm\">配線用の切欠きやヒンジ穴の追加も簡単</h3>\r\n                                    <div class=\"l-article--column-2\">\r\n                                      <div class=\"article__content\"><img src=\"/assets/images/products/semi_order/53/img_detail_03.jpg\" class=\"js-modal--image\"></div>\r\n                                      <div class=\"article__content\"><img src=\"/assets/images/products/semi_order/53/img_detail_04.jpg\" class=\"js-modal--image\"></div>\r\n                                      <div class=\"article__content\"><img src=\"/assets/images/products/semi_order/53/img_detail_05.jpg\" class=\"js-modal--image\"></div>\r\n                                      <div class=\"article__content\"><img src=\"/assets/images/products/semi_order/53/img_detail_06.jpg\" class=\"js-modal--image\"></div>\r\n                                    </div>\r\n                                  </div>\r\n                                  <div class=\"article__content\">\r\n                                    <ul class=\"c-list--sm-disc\">\r\n                                      <li class=\"list__item\">ヒンジ（蝶番）を固定する丸穴、ケーブルを通す切欠き、着脱時に指をかける切欠きなど、オプションの指定も簡単です。</li>\r\n                                      <li class=\"list__item\">細かい寸法の指定も可能なので、希望する位置にピッタリあった違和感のない見た目になります。</li>\r\n                                    </ul>\r\n                                  </div>\r\n                                </div>\r\n                              </div>\r\n                              <div id=\"spec\" class=\"detail__section js-flow\">\r\n                                <h2 class=\"c-heading--lg-border\">製品仕様</h2>\r\n                                <div class=\"l-article--column-1\">\r\n                                  <div class=\"article__content\">\r\n                                    <table class=\"c-table\">\r\n                                      <tbody>\r\n                                        <tr>\r\n                                          <th colspan=\"2\" class=\"u-width--40\">素材</th>\r\n                                          <td>アクリル</td>\r\n                                        </tr>\r\n                                        <tr>\r\n                                          <th colspan=\"2\">色</th>\r\n                                          <td>全4色（クリアー／グレースモーク／ブラウンスモーク／ガラスエッジ）<br><a data-target=\"color-01\" class=\"js-modal__trigger--open\"><i class=\"link__icon--before c-icon--triangle-r\"></i>色見本</a>\r\n                                            <div id=\"color-01\" class=\"c-window--md js-modal__content\">\r\n                                              <div class=\"l-article--column-2\">\r\n                                                <div class=\"article__content\"><img src=\"/assets/images/products/semi_order/53/img_color_clear.jpg\">\r\n                                                  <p class=\"c-text--lg-center-weightBold\">クリアー</p>\r\n                                                </div>\r\n                                                <div class=\"article__content\"><img src=\"/assets/images/products/semi_order/53/img_color_graySmoke.