 <dd class=\"set__content\">\r\n                      <div class=\"content__unit\">\r\n                        <p class=\"unit__inline\">\r\n                          <input name=\"tate\" type=\"text\" id=\"tate\" onchange=\"calculate(0);global_weight();\"\r\n                            maxlength=\"3\"><span>mm</span>\r\n                        </p>\r\n                      </div>\r\n                      <ul class=\"c-list--sm-note\">\r\n                        <li class=\"list__item\" id=\"gDRange\">50～600mm</li>\r\n                      </ul>\r\n                    </dd>\r\n                  </dl>\r\n                  <dl class=\"section__set\">\r\n                    <dt class=\"set__item\">外寸法<br>高さ</dt>\r\n                    <dd class=\"set__content\">\r\n                      <div class=\"content__unit\">\r\n                        <p class=\"unit__inline\">\r\n                          <input name=\"takasa\" type=\"text\" id=\"takasa\" onchange=\"calculate(0);global_weight();\"\r\n                            maxlength=\"3\"><span>mm</span>\r\n                        </p>\r\n                      </div>\r\n                      <ul class=\"c-list--sm-note\">\r\n                        <li class=\"list__item\" id=\"gHRange\">50～600mm</li>\r\n                      </ul>\r\n                    </dd>\r\n                  </dl>\r\n                  <ul class=\"c-list--sm-note\">\r\n                    <li class=\"list__item\">最小サイズ：幅＋奥行＋高さ≧900mm</li>\r\n                  </ul>\r\n                  <dl class=\"section__set\">\r\n                    <dt class=\"set__item\">内寸法<br>幅</dt>\r\n                    <dd class=\"set__content\">\r\n                      <div class=\"content__unit\">\r\n                        <p class=\"unit__inline\">\r\n                          <input name=\"yoko_n\" type=\"text\" id=\"yoko_n\" onchange=\"calculate()\" maxlength=\"3\"\r\n                            tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"content__number form__output\"><span>mm</span>\r\n                        </p>\r\n                      </div>\r\n                    </dd>\r\n                  </dl>\r\n                  <dl class=\"section__set\">\r\n                    <dt class=\"set__item\">内寸法<br>奥行</dt>\r\n                    <dd class=\"set__content\">\r\n                      <div class=\"content__unit\">\r\n                        <p class=\"unit__inline\">\r\n                          <input name=\"tate_n\" type=\"text\" id=\"tate_n\" onchange=\"calculate()\" maxlength=\"3\"\r\n                            tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"content__number form__output\"><span>mm</span>\r\n                        </p>\r\n                      </div>\r\n                    </dd>\r\n                  </dl>\r\n                  <dl class=\"section__set\">\r\n                    <dt class=\"set__item\">内寸法<br>高さ</dt>\r\n                    <dd class=\"set__content\">\r\n                      <div class=\"content__unit\">\r\n                        <p class=\"unit__inline\">\r\n                          <input name=\"takasa_n\" type=\"text\" id=\"takasa_n\" onchange=\"calculate()\" maxlength=\"3\"\r\n                            tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"content__number form__output\"><span>mm</span>\r\n                        </p>\r\n                      </div>\r\n                    </dd>\r\n                  </dl>\r\n                  <dl class=\"section__set\">\r\n                    <dt class=\"set__item\">重量</dt>\r\n                    <dd class=\"set__content\">\r\n                      <div class=\"content__unit\">\r\n                        <p class=\"unit__inline\"><span>約</span>\r\n                          <input name=\"juryo\" type=\"text\" id=\"juryo\" tabindex=\"-1\" maxlength=\"12\" readonly=\"\"\r\n                            class=\"content__number form__output\"><span>kg</span>\r\n                        </p>\r\n                      </div>\r\n                    </dd>\r\n                  </dl>\r\n                </div>\r\n              </div>\r\n              <div class=\"article__content-w50\">\r\n                <img src=\"/storage/images/catalog/foodCover/img_step4_01.jpg\" class=\"js-modal--image\" id=\"coverType\">\r\n                <figcaption id=\"coverImage\" class=\"item__caption c-text--lg-center\">開口面は前面、底面</figcaption>\r\n              </div>\r\n            </div>\r\n          </section>\r\n          <!--step 4-->\r\n          <section id=\"step-04\" class=\"l-article--column-1 c-flame--xs-semiorder\">\r\n            <h3 class=\"c-heading--md\">\r\n              <p class=\"heading__sub--before c-label--lg-primary\">STEP 4</p>内容の確認\r\n            </h3>\r\n            <div class=\"l-article--column-1-center\">\r\n              <div class=\"article__content\">\r\n                <p class=\"c-text--md-danger\">寸法入力は全てmm(ミリ)単位です。<br>ご注文後の単位間違いによる交換はいたしませんので、入力した内容は必ずご確認ください。</p>\r\n                <div class=\"c-flame--xs-gray-column-2-center\">\r\n                  <div class=\"flame__content\">\r\n                    <button type=\"button\" onclick=\"h_graf(1)\" class=\"c-button--md-zumen u-width--100\">図面確認</button>\r\n                    <button type=\"button\" onclick=\"h_graf3d()\"\r\n                      class=\"c-button--md-zumen u-width--100 u-margin--top-16 u-display--none-sm\">3D形状確認</button>\r\n                  </div>\r\n                  <div class=\"flame__content\">\r\n                    <p class=\"c-text--center\">\r\n                      <label class=\"form__checkbox c-text--md-weightBold\">\r\n                        <input name=\"drawing_check\" id=\"drawing_check\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"1\" tabindex=\"61\"><i\r\n                          class=\"checkbox__button\"></i>確認チェック\r\n                      </label>\r\n                    </p>\r\n                  </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n                <p>数量・金額を確認後、「カートに入れる」ボタンをクリックして下さい。</p>\r\n              </div>\r\n            </div>\r\n          </section>\r\n          <div class=\"l-article--column-1\">\r\n            <button type=\"button\" onclick=\"Reset();calculate(0);global_weight();\"\r\n              class=\"c-button--sm-gray\">入力内容を全てリセット</button>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n      </div>\r\n      <div class=\"detail__fullorder c-flame--xs-gray-column-2-vertical\">\r\n        <div class=\"flame__content\">\r\n          <p class=\"c-text--sm-weightBold\">セミオーダーでご希望の仕様が指定できない場合、フルオーダーにてお問い合わせ下さい。</p>\r\n        </div>\r\n        <div class=\"flame__content\"><a href=\"/full_order/\" target=\"_blank\"\r\n            class=\"c-button--sm-primary u-width--100\">詳細はこちら<i\r\n              class=\"button__icon--after c-icon--arrow-r-white\"></i></a></div>\r\n      </div>\r\n      {%revision_history%}\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n</form>\r\n\r\n<script>\r\n  window.onload = function () {\r\n    global_weight();\r\n    Reset();\r\n    calculate(1);\r\n  };\r\n\r\n</script>','2019-11-16 04:08:26','2026-09-11 02:24:37'),(61,346,'<form method=\"post\" action=\"/cgibin/cart-n/ex/cart.cgi\" name=\"form_semiorder\" id=\"form_semiorder\" onsubmit=\"return false;\" class=\"p-overview--semiorder c-form js-scrollFixed\">\r\n                          <!-- デフォルトパラメーター-->\r\n                          <div>\r\n                            <script type=\"text/javascript\">document.write(\'<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"url\" id=\"url\" value=\"\' + location.href + \'\" />\');</script>\r\n                            <input id=\"itemno\" type=\"hidden\" name=\"itemno\" value=\"yonmen_semiorder\">\r\n                            <input id=\"itemna\" name=\"itemna\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"アクリルフードカバー セミオーダー\">\r\n                            <input id=\"itemsh\" type=\"hidden\" name=\"itemsh\">\r\n                            <input id=\"opt2\" type=\"hidden\" name=\"opt2\">\r\n                            <input id=\"suryo\" name=\"suryo\" type=\"HIDDEN\" value=\"\">\r\n                            <input id=\"sipri\" type=\"hidden\" name=\"sipri\" value=\"::0\">\r\n        